{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b12fb6cf776de6cab3c92c85a86033d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The mugs look great! I love the logo and the look of them on clear adhesive, they&#039;re practically invisible. Are the stickers waterproof?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886696,"PostDate":1424252514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The mugs look great! I love the logo and the look of them on clear adhesive, they're practically invisible. Are the stickers waterproof?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca17bd02fa4db0fb2660ea5e2a58d4f5","RawContent":"Haha is that a David&#039;s bridal swatch in begonia?  I may have had one of those :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886697,"PostDate":1424252591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Haha is that a David's bridal swatch in begonia?  I may have had one of those <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6fc90ac5d5dfa24a17b7eab7feb8357d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"AyeWatSoon\"] So happy to hear that the board is helping you out!&amp;nbsp; For me it was a reality check that a lot of things needed to be dealt with but in about a week or so we were able to really work through our list so it does feel great to see some of the stickies come off.&amp;nbsp; It also means that both myself and my fianc\u00e9 are equally involved and active at working through these tasks.&amp;nbsp; I love it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@TinkerSofi&amp;nbsp; We have tested them out and they are definitely waterproof.&amp;nbsp;We love that they are invisible.   I&#039;m envisioning some yummy strawberry daqueries filling up the cups to add some colour! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@Calgarybride2015&amp;nbsp; as always, so helpful.&amp;nbsp; Thank you for the packing tips.&amp;nbsp; I hadn&#039;t thought that far ahead yet.&amp;nbsp; How many did you take with you? Did they take up an entire luggage?  &amp;nbsp; Yes - it was definitely a Begonia colour swatch from David&#039;s bridal.&amp;nbsp; We went a whole other route with our wedding colours!  &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding colours - up next !&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886701,"PostDate":1424256218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276925\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276925-ayewatsoon\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AyeWatSoon<\/span><\/a> So happy to hear that the board is helping you out!\u00a0 For me it was a reality check that a lot of things needed to be dealt with but in about a week or so we were able to really work through our list so it does feel great to see some of the stickies come off.\u00a0 It also means that both myself and my fianc\u00e9 are equally involved and active at working through these tasks.\u00a0 I love it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@TinkerSofi\u00a0 We have tested them out and they are definitely waterproof.\u00a0We love that they are invisible.\u00a0\u00a0 I'm envisioning some yummy strawberry daqueries filling up the cups to add some colour! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@Calgarybride2015\u00a0 as always, so helpful.\u00a0 Thank you for the packing tips.\u00a0 I hadn't thought that far ahead yet.\u00a0 How many did you take with you? Did they take up an entire luggage?\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Yes - it was definitely a Begonia colour swatch from David's bridal.\u00a0 We went a whole other route with our wedding colours!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding colours - up next !\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08b3c8288dec1ffb280e3d88b902fa24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalero\"] I need to go get some bristol board this week and start this. It&#039;s hard when my fiance and I don&#039;t live in the same house because we can&#039;t really have an exact copy of it but i&#039;m sure we can work around that. maybe there&#039;s some kind of shared internet board where we can write notes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When we were considering doing tumblers I had such a hard time finding waterproof labels! We had figured something out and I had a few supplies but then we changed our mind :P. At least I&#039;ll still be able to use the supplies though so not all is lost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886707,"PostDate":1424262014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@veryvalero I need to go get some bristol board this week and start this. It's hard when my fiance and I don't live in the same house because we can't really have an exact copy of it but i'm sure we can work around that. maybe there's some kind of shared internet board where we can write notes.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When we were considering doing tumblers I had such a hard time finding waterproof labels! We had figured something out and I had a few supplies but then we changed our mind <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. At least I'll still be able to use the supplies though so not all is lost.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58874f72ee458161e11010a48544e368","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;\t  &amp;nbsp; @TinkerSofi&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The material we used is called&amp;nbsp; permanent vinyl stick.&amp;nbsp; My FI works in the print industry and we were able to recover some scraps!&amp;nbsp; So it worked out nicely ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just found this really cool online stormboard link:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;\t It might solve the distance issue and it is free!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886708,"PostDate":1424262769,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 @TinkerSofi\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The material we used is called\u00a0 permanent vinyl stick.\u00a0 My FI works in the print industry and we were able to recover some scraps!\u00a0 So it worked out nicely <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just found this really cool online stormboard link:\u00a0 <a href='https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 It might solve the distance issue and it is free!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36dbb80ab90ed3e12ecc45d58145b008","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalero\" post=\"1886708\" timestamp=\"1424280769\"]\n[url=\"https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/\"]https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/[\/url]\t    @TinkerSofi \n\nThe material we used is called  permanent vinyl stick.  My FI works in the print industry and we were able to recover some scraps!  So it worked out nicely ;)\n\nI just found this really cool online stormboard link:  [url=\"https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/\"]https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/[\/url]\t It might solve the distance issue and it is free![\/quote]that&#039;s perfect! I&#039;ll start something today. \n\nAnd that&#039;s great that your fiance was able to get those for free :). I love free things hahah, especially when it comes to planning things for the wedding, every dollar counts.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886715,"PostDate":1424264010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalero, on 18 February 2015 - 12:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 @TinkerSofi\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The material we used is called\u00a0 permanent vinyl stick.\u00a0 My FI works in the print industry and we were able to recover some scraps!\u00a0 So it worked out nicely <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just found this really cool online stormboard link:\u00a0 <a href='https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/realtimeboard.com\/<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 It might solve the distance issue and it is free!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>that's perfect! I'll start something today.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And that's great that your fiance was able to get those for free <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I love free things hahah, especially when it comes to planning things for the wedding, every dollar counts.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d589c98ad5c5361e5ed8b5cbd0ece98a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalero\" post=\"1886701\" timestamp=\"1424274218\"]\n@[member=\"AyeWatSoon\"] So happy to hear that the board is helping you out!  For me it was a reality check that a lot of things needed to be dealt with but in about a week or so we were able to really work through our list so it does feel great to see some of the stickies come off.  It also means that both myself and my fianc\u00e9 are equally involved and active at working through these tasks.  I love it. \n\n@TinkerSofi  We have tested them out and they are definitely waterproof. We love that they are invisible.   I&#039;m envisioning some yummy strawberry daqueries filling up the cups to add some colour! :)\n\n@Calgarybride2015  as always, so helpful.  Thank you for the packing tips.  I hadn&#039;t thought that far ahead yet.  How many did you take with you? Did they take up an entire luggage?    Yes - it was definitely a Begonia colour swatch from David&#039;s bridal.  We went a whole other route with our wedding colours!   \nWedding colours - up next ![\/quote]\n\nMy girls are in the David&#039;s Bridal from Begonia if you wanted to see it in action!!!  LOVED it.\nI brought 48 mugs. I got 40 in one large 30\" (ish) suitcase. I didn&#039;t stack mine though as I had them full of goodies. I wrapped each one individually with bubble wrap.   Then I wrapped 10 or so straws together in bubble wrap and packed them tightly into a rubbermaid container that went into a larger suitcase.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886716,"PostDate":1424264021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalero, on 18 February 2015 - 10:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276925\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276925-ayewatsoon\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AyeWatSoon<\/span><\/a> So happy to hear that the board is helping you out!\u00a0 For me it was a reality check that a lot of things needed to be dealt with but in about a week or so we were able to really work through our list so it does feel great to see some of the stickies come off.\u00a0 It also means that both myself and my fianc\u00e9 are equally involved and active at working through these tasks.\u00a0 I love it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@TinkerSofi\u00a0 We have tested them out and they are definitely waterproof.\u00a0We love that they are invisible.\u00a0\u00a0 I'm envisioning some yummy strawberry daqueries filling up the cups to add some colour! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@Calgarybride2015\u00a0 as always, so helpful.\u00a0 Thank you for the packing tips.\u00a0 I hadn't thought that far ahead yet.\u00a0 How many did you take with you? Did they take up an entire luggage?\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Yes - it was definitely a Begonia colour swatch from David's bridal.\u00a0 We went a whole other route with our wedding colours!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding colours - up next !\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My girls are in the David's Bridal from Begonia if you wanted to see it in action!!! \u00a0LOVED it.<\/p>\n<p>I brought 48 mugs. I got 40 in one large 30\" (ish) suitcase. I didn't stack mine though as I had them full of goodies. I wrapped each one individually with bubble wrap. \u00a0 Then I wrapped 10 or so straws together in bubble wrap and packed them tightly into a rubbermaid container that went into a larger suitcase.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.201.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c5c7088633dc109b2212e593cb6615e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just came from a wedding at that resort :) It&#039;s a beautiful place, you&#039;re gonna love it!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886759,"PostDate":1424282718,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just came from a wedding at that resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It's a beautiful place, you're gonna love it!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dnyomba@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.66.184","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390097858,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsSam","Id":276191,"Name":"FutureMrsSam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.68.33.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a95c80a1c49b6b3647f1f79e624e4786","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Wedding Colours!!&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;I was so torn about deciding &amp;nbsp;what our wedding colours would be! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m a jewellery designer so I love combining colours and felt extra pressure to pick the best combo. &amp;nbsp;I wanted to pick a colour that would be very classy and yet reflect the chill atmosphere we are trying to create.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Soo...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I picked &lt;strong&gt;coral &amp;amp; gold&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;With sub colours &amp;nbsp;like cream and a navy blue (groomsmen)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The BM dresses are Henka dresses that I was able to find at Kleinfeld&#039;s. &amp;nbsp;They will do the alterations on site for $20. &amp;nbsp;The Henka dresses are convertible dresses and can be worn in so many different ways which means that everyone can wear the same dress and but wear it differently to suit their shape and preference. &amp;nbsp;The dresses are very light so I am told and they are ankle length so they can literally wear flipflops if they want.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am designing their jewellery but I haven&#039;t quite yet but I will post pictures once I decide on the design. &amp;nbsp;I am inspired by some of previous designs. &amp;nbsp;(See pics)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;My bouquet&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; will have soft creams, whites and coral flowers, bridesmaids will have cream flowers mixed with greens to give it that wild effect.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Centrepieces: &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;I have been experimenting at home making some of my own centrepieces. &amp;nbsp;Haven&#039;t decided yet but thought I would share my simple and inexpensive DIY centrepiece pics. &amp;nbsp;I turned a big shell into flower holder and inserted some flowers to give it that nice tropical look. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nHoping to work some more on my todo lists this weekend! &amp;nbsp;xoxo&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886906,"PostDate":1424380541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>Wedding Colours!!<\/u><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">I was so torn about deciding \u00a0what our wedding colours would be! \u00a0I'm a jewellery designer so I love combining colours and felt extra pressure to pick the best combo. \u00a0I wanted to pick a colour that would be very classy and yet reflect the chill atmosphere we are trying to create.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Soo...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I picked <strong>coral & gold\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>With sub colours \u00a0like cream and a navy blue (groomsmen)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The BM dresses are Henka dresses that I was able to find at Kleinfeld's. \u00a0They will do the alterations on site for $20. \u00a0The Henka dresses are convertible dresses and can be worn in so many different ways which means that everyone can wear the same dress and but wear it differently to suit their shape and preference. \u00a0The dresses are very light so I am told and they are ankle length so they can literally wear flipflops if they want.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886906]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-40951800-1424398264.jpg\" title=\"IMG_2599.JPG -  102.34KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-40951800-1424398264.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_2599.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886906]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-20569200-1424398215.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0772.jpg -  75.96KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-20569200-1424398215.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0772.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am designing their jewellery but I haven't quite yet but I will post pictures once I decide on the design. \u00a0I am inspired by some of previous designs. \u00a0(See pics)\u00a0<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886906]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-94225400-1424398439.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0723.JPG -  41.25KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-94225400-1424398439.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0723.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886906]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-88398600-1424398456.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0029.JPG -  47.11KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-88398600-1424398456.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0029.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886906]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-40251300-1424398472.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0004.JPG -  27.31KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-40251300-1424398472.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0004.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>My bouquet<\/u><\/strong> will have soft creams, whites and coral flowers, bridesmaids will have cream flowers mixed with greens to give it that wild effect.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Centrepieces: \u00a0<\/strong>I have been experimenting at home making some of my own centrepieces. \u00a0Haven't decided yet but thought I would share my simple and inexpensive DIY centrepiece pics. \u00a0I turned a big shell into flower holder and inserted some flowers to give it that nice tropical look. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886906]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-89573100-1424398191.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0364.jpg -  80.31KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-89573100-1424398191.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0364.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886906]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-61059100-1424398172.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0282.jpg -  123.95KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-61059100-1424398172.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0282.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\nHoping to work some more on my todo lists this weekend! \u00a0xoxo\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58f244bcdc4c781059319bb809d4012c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;your colors are so classy! I love them. I keep seeing these colors pop up and I keep thinking \"darn, I should have chosen that!\" hahah.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I really like the bridesmaid dresses too! Especially the way it&#039;s worn on the third picture :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re just so creative! I&#039;m jealous haha. Keep up the good work :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886911,"PostDate":1424380907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>your colors are so classy! I love them. I keep seeing these colors pop up and I keep thinking \"darn, I should have chosen that!\" hahah.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really like the bridesmaid dresses too! Especially the way it's worn on the third picture <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're just so creative! I'm jealous haha. Keep up the good work <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":463,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":7,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
