{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56571707c38a4436a7ffa40f00ab12d9","RawContent":"I love it all too\n\n\nHave you considered a statement necklace for yourself? My friend did it and it looked awesome. I considered one in fuchsia but had no luck\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886926,"PostDate":1424384487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love it all too<br><br>\nHave you considered a statement necklace for yourself? My friend did it and it looked awesome. I considered one in fuchsia but had no luck<br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"137.186.96.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09448770ec1922c3fd4fb57054bd4df6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Awesome job so far. Can&#039;t wait for more. Love these planning threads.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886927,"PostDate":1424384643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Awesome job so far. Can't wait for more. Love these planning threads.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395328614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de1f5be4e10f0757b29e54c45871a423","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@TinkerSofi&amp;nbsp; Awww thanks!&amp;nbsp; You are so sweet.&amp;nbsp; Coral and gold are totally on trend right now...I swear I had no idea when I chose them.&amp;nbsp; lol&amp;nbsp; I was going to go the Tiffany blue route and silver but this really just felt more like the mood that I wanted.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@calgarybride2015&amp;nbsp; YES!&amp;nbsp; That&#039;s too bad that you weren&#039;t able to find a statement necklace.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m totally planning on doing what you suggested.&amp;nbsp; I was thinking of a small necklace for the ceremony or no necklace and then statement necklace for the reception.&amp;nbsp; :D   I just have to get my dress first....eek.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@kcole123&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m so glad it&#039;s helpful to you!&amp;nbsp; Stay tuned my dress is next ! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;xoxo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;THE DRESS!!!&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To be honest, the whole dress shopping process was a little difficult\/sad for me.&amp;nbsp; My mother had passed away a few years ago and while&amp;nbsp;I have grieved and gone through the healing process, I knew I would always be very sad about her absence if I ever were to get married.&amp;nbsp; I was never the&amp;nbsp;kind of girl that thought about getting married, or envisioned what kind of dress I would wear so it was overwhelming to start looking.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was engaged on Valentine&#039;s day 2014 and I didn&#039;t start looking for dresses until September.&amp;nbsp; My wedding is June 20th, and I suppose I&#039;m cutting it pretty close.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m told that I have to order by this Monday. lol&amp;nbsp; So Monday it is!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thankfully I have amazing friends, my sister and my Mother-in-law who have been nothing but supportive and have come with me to my appointments.&amp;nbsp; It certainly helped not feel as sad that mom isn&#039;t here for this epic occasion.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One of the dress fittings was just my sister and I, we walked in, saw the dress, I tried it on, and there were tears.&amp;nbsp; I was sooo sure it was the one.&amp;nbsp; I decided to think on it...I think it&#039;s the one.&amp;nbsp; For some reason I feel like I could find something better...I don&#039;t know if that&#039;s just normal and part of the process.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will post a picture of my #1 choice and some of the 2nd, 3rd, 4th choices.&amp;nbsp; Any feedback would be welcomed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Is it normal to feel like this unsure.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s crazy!&amp;nbsp; lol&amp;nbsp; I do love my #1 but I still keep thinking about what else could be out there.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;#1&amp;nbsp; Fit and Flare&amp;nbsp; (David&#039;s bridal)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;#2 Ballroom gown (Kleinfelds&#039;s)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;#3&amp;nbsp; A-line flare (david&#039;s bridal)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;#4 Fit and Flare - cream (DB)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":30685,"Name":"IMG_2589.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-99520800-1424447955.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-99520800-1424447955_thumb.jpg","Width":600,"Height":800},{"Id":30686,"Name":"IMG_2592.PNG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-45424900-1424448019.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-45424900-1424448019_thumb.png","Width":640,"Height":1136},{"Id":30687,"Name":"IMG_2540.PNG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-47461600-1424448072.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-47461600-1424448072_thumb.png","Width":640,"Height":1136},{"Id":30688,"Name":"IMG_2562.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-48355800-1424448129.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-48355800-1424448129_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200}],"Id":1886957,"PostDate":1424430239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@TinkerSofi\u00a0 Awww thanks!\u00a0 You are so sweet.\u00a0 Coral and gold are totally on trend right now...I swear I had no idea when I chose them.\u00a0 lol\u00a0 I was going to go the Tiffany blue route and silver but this really just felt more like the mood that I wanted.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@calgarybride2015\u00a0 YES!\u00a0 That's too bad that you weren't able to find a statement necklace.\u00a0 I'm totally planning on doing what you suggested.\u00a0 I was thinking of a small necklace for the ceremony or no necklace and then statement necklace for the reception.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0\u00a0 I just have to get my dress first....eek.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@kcole123\u00a0 I'm so glad it's helpful to you!\u00a0 Stay tuned my dress is next ! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>xoxo<\/p><br \/><p>THE DRESS!!!\u00a0 <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To be honest, the whole dress shopping process was a little difficult\/sad for me.\u00a0 My mother had passed away a few years ago and while\u00a0I have grieved and gone through the healing process, I knew I would always be very sad about her absence if I ever were to get married.\u00a0 I was never the\u00a0kind of girl that thought about getting married, or envisioned what kind of dress I would wear so it was overwhelming to start looking.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was engaged on Valentine's day 2014 and I didn't start looking for dresses until September.\u00a0 My wedding is June 20th, and I suppose I'm cutting it pretty close.\u00a0 I'm told that I have to order by this Monday. lol\u00a0 So Monday it is!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thankfully I have amazing friends, my sister and my Mother-in-law who have been nothing but supportive and have come with me to my appointments.\u00a0 It certainly helped not feel as sad that mom isn't here for this epic occasion.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One of the dress fittings was just my sister and I, we walked in, saw the dress, I tried it on, and there were tears.\u00a0 I was sooo sure it was the one.\u00a0 I decided to think on it...I think it's the one.\u00a0 For some reason I feel like I could find something better...I don't know if that's just normal and part of the process.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will post a picture of my #1 choice and some of the 2nd, 3rd, 4th choices.\u00a0 Any feedback would be welcomed.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is it normal to feel like this unsure.\u00a0 It's crazy!\u00a0 lol\u00a0 I do love my #1 but I still keep thinking about what else could be out there.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>#1\u00a0 Fit and Flare\u00a0 (David's bridal)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>#2 Ballroom gown (Kleinfelds's)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>#3\u00a0 A-line flare (david's bridal)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>#4 Fit and Flare - cream (DB)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1424440700,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96e0961d3d07cd471c2dff2e99f2f5aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m sure it was tough to go without your mom. Moments like these are always tough, but I&#039;m glad you had supportive people around you to help you out :).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I like dress #1 and #2 the best. I really like how the color of #2 looks on you. I think brighter whites look really nice on your skin tone. I also like a fit a flare with a belt like on #1. I keep going to #2 though so I guess that&#039;s my fave :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Edit: in terms of feeling somewhat unsure of which one to pick and whether there&#039;s better ones out there I think it&#039;s totally normal. I felt like that for a couple of months and I think we always wonder whether we could find something better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Now, if there&#039;s anything I learned on my psychology degree, after we make a choice our brains automatically extra convince themselves that we made the right choice. Basically you look at your choice under rose covered glasses :) hahah. So I think as long as you love your dress now, if you commit to it and don&#039;t keep shopping around you&#039;ll be happy with your choice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s normal for pretty much everyone to second guess their dress from time to time because there are so many choices! My best advice is to try and not think about \"could I have gotten something better?\", chances are that if you searched high and low forever yes, you will find something better, but what&#039;s the point? are you happy with your dress? Do you see yourself walking down the aisle with it feeling like a queen? that&#039;s all you need ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886980,"PostDate":1424440254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm sure it was tough to go without your mom. Moments like these are always tough, but I'm glad you had supportive people around you to help you out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I like dress #1 and #2 the best. I really like how the color of #2 looks on you. I think brighter whites look really nice on your skin tone. I also like a fit a flare with a belt like on #1. I keep going to #2 though so I guess that's my fave <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Edit: in terms of feeling somewhat unsure of which one to pick and whether there's better ones out there I think it's totally normal. I felt like that for a couple of months and I think we always wonder whether we could find something better.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Now, if there's anything I learned on my psychology degree, after we make a choice our brains automatically extra convince themselves that we made the right choice. Basically you look at your choice under rose covered glasses <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> hahah. So I think as long as you love your dress now, if you commit to it and don't keep shopping around you'll be happy with your choice.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's normal for pretty much everyone to second guess their dress from time to time because there are so many choices! My best advice is to try and not think about \"could I have gotten something better?\", chances are that if you searched high and low forever yes, you will find something better, but what's the point? are you happy with your dress? Do you see yourself walking down the aisle with it feeling like a queen? that's all you need <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6c1ad91005b9fef5aea21f207593d89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Lovely thread!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also like dress #1 and 2 but it certainly is a choice you have to be comfortable with. As far as being unsure, I emphatically say YES IT IS NORMAL. It&#039;s a big decision so it is very normal to be hesitant to make a final decision. There are so many options out there too so I feel like if you keep looking you will always find something else that you like or could like. I think you have tried a good variety of styles of dresses so if you are leaning towards one dress, it&#039;s probably right! Good luck and can&#039;t wait to read &amp;nbsp;more xo&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886982,"PostDate":1424441658,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Lovely thread!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also like dress #1 and 2 but it certainly is a choice you have to be comfortable with. As far as being unsure, I emphatically say YES IT IS NORMAL. It's a big decision so it is very normal to be hesitant to make a final decision. There are so many options out there too so I feel like if you keep looking you will always find something else that you like or could like. I think you have tried a good variety of styles of dresses so if you are leaning towards one dress, it's probably right! Good luck and can't wait to read \u00a0more xo\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361719826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c890d47df88cb9a944e365b5b9c6c74d","RawContent":"I love all the dresses but #2 is my fave on you :)\n\n\nI also second what the other ladies said !!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886989,"PostDate":1424443116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love all the dresses but #2 is my fave on you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI also second what the other ladies said !!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.221.156","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71d569cfb26569e2547b34cc1dbf5e95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I can see why this is such a hard decision. I am partial to lace myself, and not too much poof, but having said that, I have to agree with the ladies above, there is something about #2 that I love on you! All of them are beautiful so whatever you choose will look great!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As a side note, I also tried on #3 and it was my third choice. However, I knew I recognized it from some where and could not figure our how. I went back and tried on all 3 the next day and it hit me, one of my good friends chose that dress for her wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All are beautiful, go with what you love!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886992,"PostDate":1424444112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I can see why this is such a hard decision. I am partial to lace myself, and not too much poof, but having said that, I have to agree with the ladies above, there is something about #2 that I love on you! All of them are beautiful so whatever you choose will look great!!<\/p>\n<p>As a side note, I also tried on #3 and it was my third choice. However, I knew I recognized it from some where and could not figure our how. I went back and tried on all 3 the next day and it hit me, one of my good friends chose that dress for her wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All are beautiful, go with what you love!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen.tipler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.221.156","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404855744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278914.jpg?_r=1427504777","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissJen3","Id":278914,"Name":"MissJen3","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca39fb8cdd36ab0e8417c7d96b27a4db","RawContent":"@[member=\"veryvalero\"] I love everything you&#039;ve done so far! You are so creative! I especially love that centerpiece with the shell. Looks tropical and classy :)\n\n\nI love the coral bridesmaid&#039;s dress, especially with the jewels on the third pic. My colours are coral and grey!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887007,"PostDate":1424456967,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @veryvalero I love everything you've done so far! You are so creative! I especially love that centerpiece with the shell. Looks tropical and classy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI love the coral bridesmaid's dress, especially with the jewels on the third pic. My colours are coral and grey!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410080585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1424861667,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":14,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c40751311508b7ff064d42069a94db6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:24px;\"&gt;I said yes!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It was an emotional evening but I finally said yes to my dress!&amp;nbsp; I decided to go with my #&lt;strong&gt;1 pick&lt;\/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp; There are so many elements that I love about this dress and it suits the beach wedding.&amp;nbsp; it&#039;s also not very heavy and I wasn&#039;t sweating in it compared to another dress made out of satin.(Just in the store alone I was sweating buckets.)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So my next big decision was to figure out what size I wanted to order the dress in.&amp;nbsp; Back in October 2014 I tried the dress on in a size 18.&amp;nbsp; I returned two weeks ago and tried on the 16 and it was TIGHT.&amp;nbsp; I was determined to order the dress in a size 14 and work towards that goal.&amp;nbsp; I have been on a weight loss journey and that is another reason I chose this dress because I felt it would really showcase that weight loss.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had two weeks to try the dress on again and order it and try to lose some more weight to see if I could fit into the 16 a little better.&amp;nbsp; I decided that if I could lose enough in two weeks to fit into the 16, then I will definitely order the size 14.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So the good news is that I actually was able to fit into the dress better and I ordered a size 14 which I am so excited about. &amp;nbsp;It is a corset dress so if it&#039;s too big then I can always tighten it up. &amp;nbsp;I am not even going to consider what would happen if it&#039;s too small. &amp;nbsp;I am very motivated and I know I can do it! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(I am a lefty, so I posted my before and after as \"after and before\"&amp;nbsp; lol)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;First picture = two days ago&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Second picture = two weeks ago same dress size&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yay! &amp;nbsp;xoxo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887479,"PostDate":1424861527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:24px\">I said yes!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It was an emotional evening but I finally said yes to my dress!\u00a0 I decided to go with my #<strong>1 pick<\/strong>.\u00a0 There are so many elements that I love about this dress and it suits the beach wedding.\u00a0 it's also not very heavy and I wasn't sweating in it compared to another dress made out of satin.(Just in the store alone I was sweating buckets.)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So my next big decision was to figure out what size I wanted to order the dress in.\u00a0 Back in October 2014 I tried the dress on in a size 18.\u00a0 I returned two weeks ago and tried on the 16 and it was TIGHT.\u00a0 I was determined to order the dress in a size 14 and work towards that goal.\u00a0 I have been on a weight loss journey and that is another reason I chose this dress because I felt it would really showcase that weight loss.<\/p>\n<p>I had two weeks to try the dress on again and order it and try to lose some more weight to see if I could fit into the 16 a little better.\u00a0 I decided that if I could lose enough in two weeks to fit into the 16, then I will definitely order the size 14.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So the good news is that I actually was able to fit into the dress better and I ordered a size 14 which I am so excited about. \u00a0It is a corset dress so if it's too big then I can always tighten it up. \u00a0I am not even going to consider what would happen if it's too small. \u00a0I am very motivated and I know I can do it! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>(I am a lefty, so I posted my before and after as \"after and before\"\u00a0 lol)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>First picture = two days ago<\/p>\n<p>Second picture = two weeks ago same dress size\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yay! \u00a0xoxo<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1887479]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-19638800-1424879256.jpg\" title=\"IMG_2748.JPG -  129.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-277519-0-19638800-1424879256.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_2748.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.91.171.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de712af6b8b030a91d4b346a944a2ae0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats!! Beautiful dress on you!! We have very similar colors!! YAY!!!! Can&#039;t wait to read more about your planning process.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887485,"PostDate":1424865300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats!! Beautiful dress on you!! We have very similar colors!! YAY!!!! Can't wait to read more about your planning process.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409073107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":463,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":7,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
