Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e0eacb212352d0d95d749f9d4c86fd7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I never thought I would change my name and my fiance does not care at all what I do, but I am going to. I am going to change my middle name officially to my maiden name (I never cared for my middle name so...good riddance!) And if we have children their middle name will be my maiden name. I can&#039;t let go of my name completely! Fortunately his last name is phonetic, 2 syllables and moves me up in the alphabet from S to H. Haha.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We work for the same company though so I may keep my maiden name at work. We work with some of the same people occasionally and I&#039;d rather they see me as an individual professional.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889713,"PostDate":1426597195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I never thought I would change my name and my fiance does not care at all what I do, but I am going to. I am going to change my middle name officially to my maiden name (I never cared for my middle name so...good riddance!) And if we have children their middle name will be my maiden name. I can't let go of my name completely! Fortunately his last name is phonetic, 2 syllables and moves me up in the alphabet from S to H. Haha.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We work for the same company though so I may keep my maiden name at work. We work with some of the same people occasionally and I'd rather they see me as an individual professional.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403098087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427368799,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a988f192bfa039a15950bcc24fa5774","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Still recovering from my second degree burns - but I&#039;m doing way better than I was last week.&amp;nbsp; I decided to star tackling the little things on the to-do-list that I have been avoiding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The FI and I are so excited because we finally came up with the music for the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; We are huge music fans and it&#039;s hard to pick tracks for such a special day that aren&#039;t too cheesy and commercial.&amp;nbsp; We were avoiding any typical wedding songs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are our choices:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-ceremony while guests arrive&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sea of Love -&amp;nbsp; Cat Power&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Us - Regina Spektor&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Amber- 311&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal party entrance&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Fools Rush In - Ingrid Michaelson&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bride Grand Entrance&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Song for Zula - Phosphoresent&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bride and Groom Grand Exit &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Home - Edward Sharpe &amp;amp; the Magnetic Zeros&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m missing a song for the signing of the papers but I will keep adding to this list.&amp;nbsp; We were listening to our songs last night and totally felt rush and excitement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890849,"PostDate":1427368780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Still recovering from my second degree burns - but I'm doing way better than I was last week.\u00a0 I decided to star tackling the little things on the to-do-list that I have been avoiding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The FI and I are so excited because we finally came up with the music for the ceremony.\u00a0 We are huge music fans and it's hard to pick tracks for such a special day that aren't too cheesy and commercial.\u00a0 We were avoiding any typical wedding songs.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are our choices:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Pre-ceremony while guests arrive<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Sea of Love -\u00a0 Cat Power<\/p>\n<p>Us - Regina Spektor<\/p>\n<p>Amber- 311<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal party entrance<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Fools Rush In - Ingrid Michaelson<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bride Grand Entrance<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Song for Zula - Phosphoresent<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bride and Groom Grand Exit <\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Home - Edward Sharpe & the Magnetic Zeros<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm missing a song for the signing of the papers but I will keep adding to this list.\u00a0 We were listening to our songs last night and totally felt rush and excitement.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81b5226d88aa6620ed9db8ae12b7cfd9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Aw I love it that you guys are so much into music! I haven&#039;t heard of those songs but I&#039;ll look some of them up when I&#039;m home :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I live under a rock so I don&#039;t know much about music or artists or anything. It kinda sucks sometimes haha. I&#039;m recruiting one of my MOH&#039;s to help me out with the music because she&#039;s good at it :D. She planned the music for her sister&#039;s wedding and it has been one of the best weddings I&#039;ve been to!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890851,"PostDate":1427369112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Aw I love it that you guys are so much into music! I haven't heard of those songs but I'll look some of them up when I'm home <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I live under a rock so I don't know much about music or artists or anything. It kinda sucks sometimes haha. I'm recruiting one of my MOH's to help me out with the music because she's good at it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>. She planned the music for her sister's wedding and it has been one of the best weddings I've been to!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84536e7a92f1d09057d5d472b097b123","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4&lt;\/a&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This was definitely a fun part of the process.&amp;nbsp; I love those heartfelt songs that make you feel things!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love the music from Sleeping at last.&amp;nbsp; They have been featured in several episodes of Grey&#039;s Anatomy and I found that their music really makes you \"feel\" the episode.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They did a few covers that I&#039;m a huge fan of...here&#039;s one of them&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;500 Miles - sleeping at last&amp;nbsp; (link above)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890854,"PostDate":1427369461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.youtube....h?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4<\/a>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This was definitely a fun part of the process.\u00a0 I love those heartfelt songs that make you feel things!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the music from Sleeping at last.\u00a0 They have been featured in several episodes of Grey's Anatomy and I found that their music really makes you \"feel\" the episode.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They did a few covers that I'm a huge fan of...here's one of them<\/p>\n<p>500 Miles - sleeping at last\u00a0 (link above)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.149.182.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29e6559e6f5a4512ceee3b00fb67b246","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalentine\"] I&#039;m using Ingrid Michaelson for my ceremony as well!! Love her!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890855,"PostDate":1427369734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a> I'm using Ingrid Michaelson for my ceremony as well!! Love her!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415529511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0af7cb28e89450747bdd5e10f3ae3628","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalentine\" post=\"1890854\" timestamp=\"1427387461\"]\n[url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4[\/url]@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]\n\nThis was definitely a fun part of the process.  I love those heartfelt songs that make you feel things! \n\nI love the music from Sleeping at last.  They have been featured in several episodes of Grey&#039;s Anatomy and I found that their music really makes you \"feel\" the episode. \n\nThey did a few covers that I&#039;m a huge fan of...here&#039;s one of them\n500 Miles - sleeping at last  (link above)[\/quote]I love to dance so I know what you mean about songs that make you feel things ;). It&#039;s just that every time i start thinking about songs I get overwhelmed and I don&#039;t even know where to begin ahah. I do need to start tackling this though because the feeling will only get worse as time goes by. My plan is to have the \"must\" songs and then have my MOH fill in with her music. We do agree on a lot of songs so I&#039;d even be comfortable telling her to make up the whole playlist because I know i&#039;d love it lol. I just don&#039;t want to create too much work for people. \n\nAre you using an ipod to play your music there?","Attachments":[],"Id":1890856,"PostDate":1427369806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalentine, on 26 March 2015 - 11:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.youtube....h?v=yJ6wJqaE6o4<\/a>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This was definitely a fun part of the process.\u00a0 I love those heartfelt songs that make you feel things!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the music from Sleeping at last.\u00a0 They have been featured in several episodes of Grey's Anatomy and I found that their music really makes you \"feel\" the episode.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They did a few covers that I'm a huge fan of...here's one of them<\/p>\n<p>500 Miles - sleeping at last\u00a0 (link above)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love to dance so I know what you mean about songs that make you feel things <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. It's just that every time i start thinking about songs I get overwhelmed and I don't even know where to begin ahah. I do need to start tackling this though because the feeling will only get worse as time goes by. My plan is to have the \"must\" songs and then have my MOH fill in with her music. We do agree on a lot of songs so I'd even be comfortable telling her to make up the whole playlist because I know i'd love it lol. I just don't want to create too much work for people.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you using an ipod to play your music there?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427370271,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79b0e4def9607aab9ad5d52dd216ddd0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;going to use an&amp;nbsp;iPod - thank you for reminding me that I def need to start settting that up.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My only&amp;nbsp;issue is that our guests are split with some that only speak English,&amp;nbsp;a few that speak&amp;nbsp;both English and Spanish, and then a crowd that only speaks Spanish.&amp;nbsp; So&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to&amp;nbsp;let the FI&amp;nbsp;pick some Spanish&amp;nbsp;songs to so we can have a nice balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to hear your music picks.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890857,"PostDate":1427370245,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are\u00a0going to use an\u00a0iPod - thank you for reminding me that I def need to start settting that up.<\/p>\n<p>My only\u00a0issue is that our guests are split with some that only speak English,\u00a0a few that speak\u00a0both English and Spanish, and then a crowd that only speaks Spanish.\u00a0 So\u00a0I'm going to\u00a0let the FI\u00a0pick some Spanish\u00a0songs to so we can have a nice balance.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to hear your music picks.\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.46.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d1c30c20d746f934dd43dfedaeaec7e","RawContent":"Your wedding is a week after mine and you&#039;re far ahead of me in planning! I&#039;m envious ^_^\n\nThe music organization is to be led by my fiance (he used to DJ) but to him June is still SOOOO far away so I have a hard time getting him to take it seriously. I can get bits and pieces of his attention to get feedback on MY projects, but he is clearly not ready to take anything on himself yet. He hasn&#039;t even given any thought to what he is going to wear or what kind of ring he wants. I&#039;ve accepted he will be of no help close to the wedding because he&#039;ll be doing all his tasks last minute. Ah!\n[quote name=\"veryvalentine\" post=\"1890849\" timestamp=\"1427386780\"]\nStill recovering from my second degree burns - but I&#039;m doing way better than I was last week.  I decided to star tackling the little things on the to-do-list that I have been avoiding.\n\nThe FI and I are so excited because we finally came up with the music for the ceremony.  We are huge music fans and it&#039;s hard to pick tracks for such a special day that aren&#039;t too cheesy and commercial.  We were avoiding any typical wedding songs. \n\nThese are our choices:\n\n[b]Pre-ceremony while guests arrive[\/b]\nSea of Love -  Cat Power\nUs - Regina Spektor\nAmber- 311\n\n[b]Bridal party entrance[\/b]\n\nFools Rush In - Ingrid Michaelson\n\n[b]Bride Grand Entrance[\/b]\n\nSong for Zula - Phosphoresent\n\n[b]Bride and Groom Grand Exit [\/b]\nHome - Edward Sharpe &amp;amp; the Magnetic Zeros\n\nI&#039;m missing a song for the signing of the papers but I will keep adding to this list.  We were listening to our songs last night and totally felt rush and excitement.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1890862,"PostDate":1427371312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your wedding is a week after mine and you're far ahead of me in planning! I'm envious <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/happy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='^_^' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The music organization is to be led by my fiance (he used to DJ) but to him June is still SOOOO far away so I have a hard time getting him to take it seriously. I can get bits and pieces of his attention to get feedback on MY projects, but he is clearly not ready to take anything on himself yet. He hasn't even given any thought to what he is going to wear or what kind of ring he wants. I've accepted he will be of no help close to the wedding because he'll be doing all his tasks last minute. Ah!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalentine, on 26 March 2015 - 11:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Still recovering from my second degree burns - but I'm doing way better than I was last week.\u00a0 I decided to star tackling the little things on the to-do-list that I have been avoiding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The FI and I are so excited because we finally came up with the music for the ceremony.\u00a0 We are huge music fans and it's hard to pick tracks for such a special day that aren't too cheesy and commercial.\u00a0 We were avoiding any typical wedding songs.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are our choices:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Pre-ceremony while guests arrive<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Sea of Love -\u00a0 Cat Power<\/p>\n<p>Us - Regina Spektor<\/p>\n<p>Amber- 311<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal party entrance<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Fools Rush In - Ingrid Michaelson<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bride Grand Entrance<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Song for Zula - Phosphoresent<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bride and Groom Grand Exit <\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Home - Edward Sharpe & the Magnetic Zeros<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm missing a song for the signing of the papers but I will keep adding to this list.\u00a0 We were listening to our songs last night and totally felt rush and excitement.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403098087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"74019bc34ba48669343231f1a775d30d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@beckys98&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Awww, I&#039;m sure you are right where you need to be.&amp;nbsp; Trust me, there are a lot of brides on this forum whose weddings are months after mine and they are way ahead of where I am at.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve decided that I&#039;m not going to compare myself to others because all our processes are so unique and part of the fun is to enjoy the journey.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;my FI used to throw parties for a living so he&#039;s very&amp;nbsp;much leading the way as well with the planning but he has yet to make his appointment for his suit fitting or his wedding band.&amp;nbsp; lol&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890865,"PostDate":1427371695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@beckys98\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Awww, I'm sure you are right where you need to be.\u00a0 Trust me, there are a lot of brides on this forum whose weddings are months after mine and they are way ahead of where I am at.\u00a0 I've decided that I'm not going to compare myself to others because all our processes are so unique and part of the fun is to enjoy the journey.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>my FI used to throw parties for a living so he's very\u00a0much leading the way as well with the planning but he has yet to make his appointment for his suit fitting or his wedding band.\u00a0 lol\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"5ceaaf55347c5aefd57413e7bf735d03","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m having so much help lately from my fiance! It&#039;s great because I honestly didn&#039;t expect him to help at all, and if he did it would be dragging his heels.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;He has a bit more time now that school is winding down and he&#039;s pretty much done with all the hard stuff :). He&#039;s picked his suit, thinking about his shoes now. Next month we&#039;re getting his ring and he&#039;s been going around trying to organize his friends to see who&#039;s coming and contacting our TA. He also started a list of songs that he wants :). I&#039;m definitely enjoying this moment!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890867,"PostDate":1427371994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm having so much help lately from my fiance! It's great because I honestly didn't expect him to help at all, and if he did it would be dragging his heels.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>He has a bit more time now that school is winding down and he's pretty much done with all the hard stuff <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. He's picked his suit, thinking about his shoes now. Next month we're getting his ring and he's been going around trying to organize his friends to see who's coming and contacting our TA. He also started a list of songs that he wants <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I'm definitely enjoying this moment!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":463,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":7,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
