{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.114.29.176","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79266,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdcbeee39fce8d2d85fa5fa5124e2db9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Newly engaged!!! YAY! I have worked in the formal part of the wedding industry here in Texas and am really wanting to just get away from the hustle and bustle of a big Texas wedding. I have been to and LOVE the Dominican Republic but am seriously considering Jamaica since I have heard there is a lot of \"One stop shop\" resorts there. Any input on the best resorts, photography, videography, and officiants would be much appreciated for Jamaica.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Peace and Love!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Maricela&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898421,"PostDate":1434053276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Newly engaged!!! YAY! I have worked in the formal part of the wedding industry here in Texas and am really wanting to just get away from the hustle and bustle of a big Texas wedding. I have been to and LOVE the Dominican Republic but am seriously considering Jamaica since I have heard there is a lot of \"One stop shop\" resorts there. Any input on the best resorts, photography, videography, and officiants would be much appreciated for Jamaica.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Peace and Love!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maricela<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"myweddingjunk@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.114.29.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434051369,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283505.jpg?_r=1434070603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mireveles","Id":283505,"Name":"mireveles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.26.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79266,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f586a1d5d1710336881e7d344a27b82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement mireveles, and welcome to our forum community!!! you&#039;ll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are a few magical Mexican wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our gorgeous Mayan Riviera - enjoy !&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153360211499487.1073741932.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;RUI Yucatan Playacar Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513371119_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11235450_10153360215944487_75064290117880840_o.jpg\" alt=\"11235450_10153360215944487_7506429011788\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....or these from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153338826264487.1073741931.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Secrets Maroma Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11270584_10153338828284487_4135758901024209878_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270584_10153338828284487_4135758901024\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11078228_10153338828759487_2082305525722819508_o.jpg\" alt=\"11078228_10153338828759487_2082305525722\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11218557_10153338830504487_6498945632836199158_o.jpg\" alt=\"11218557_10153338830504487_6498945632836\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...or these from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153334398819487.1073741930.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;El Dorado Royale Casitas Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11212619_10153334400144487_7537306398576993553_o.jpg\" alt=\"11212619_10153334400144487_7537306398576\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11206501_10153334402389487_4001707976891488258_o.jpg\" alt=\"11206501_10153334402389487_4001707976891\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11216261_10153334404294487_5796444389739187792_n.jpg?oh=e04b547a05db34b3df58c735451444ab&amp;amp;oe=562A8FB7\" alt=\"11216261_10153334404294487_5796444389739\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488213852_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898470,"PostDate":1434113855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement mireveles, and welcome to our forum community!!! you'll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are a few magical Mexican wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our gorgeous Mayan Riviera - enjoy !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153360211499487.1073741932.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>RUI Yucatan Playacar Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513371119_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11235450_10153360215944487_75064290117880840_o.jpg\" alt=\"11235450_10153360215944487_7506429011788\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....or these from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153338826264487.1073741931.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Secrets Maroma Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11270584_10153338828284487_4135758901024209878_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270584_10153338828284487_4135758901024\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11078228_10153338828759487_2082305525722819508_o.jpg\" alt=\"11078228_10153338828759487_2082305525722\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11218557_10153338830504487_6498945632836199158_o.jpg\" alt=\"11218557_10153338830504487_6498945632836\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...or these from <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153334398819487.1073741930.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>El Dorado Royale Casitas Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11212619_10153334400144487_7537306398576993553_o.jpg\" alt=\"11212619_10153334400144487_7537306398576\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11206501_10153334402389487_4001707976891488258_o.jpg\" alt=\"11206501_10153334402389487_4001707976891\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11216261_10153334404294487_5796444389739187792_n.jpg?oh=e04b547a05db34b3df58c735451444ab&oe=562A8FB7\" alt=\"11216261_10153334404294487_5796444389739\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488213852_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":7,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
