  'SessionId' => 'c7212f55310fdf4884bb297f494a5505',
  'forumId' => '22',
  'title' => 'Hard rock',
  'postContent' => 'So I am planning our 2016 wedding for Hard Rock Punta Cana and even though the resort is well known and beautiful, the begging process has been nothing but a NIGHTMARE with the Miami office. I am praying that once I get my direct wedding planner from the resort I actually get questions answered and the process going. 



The Miami office just rushes you off the phone without answering your questions their favorite quote is "I\'ll just email you all the info" but you never get an email from them and if you do it has nothing about the questions you have! Also the contract process is 24-48 hours. Well we sent ours over Mon and got a response finally on Fri that is after I called twice! Oh, and the contract is wrong so I\'ll have to wait until mon to try and get another one sent back to me! Ughhhhhh! Looking over the wrong contract though looks like there\'s going to be a lot of nickel and diming going on! 
',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => 'c7212f55310fdf4884bb297f494a5505',
)
