My wedding is March 8th 2014&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1676363,"PostDate":1350660433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies!!! Any 2014 HR brides out there? I didn't see a specific thread for us so i figured id start one. My wedding is March 8th 2014<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c4d78be5b4dac14c06a15e1460ee0a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; April 2014 at Hard Rock Punta Cana HERE&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1350661066242_1285\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/&gt;...no exact date but month and year confirmed. Thanks for starting this...I felt left out for a moment. But already this website has helped me out with the preliminary planning and what to expect as I move forward during this process.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1676370,"PostDate":1350661258,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> April 2014 at Hard Rock Punta Cana HERE\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1350661066242_1285\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span>...no exact date but month and year confirmed. Thanks for starting this...I felt left out for a moment. But already this website has helped me out with the preliminary planning and what to expect as I move forward during this process.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchawkins1219@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347558378,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"loviesbee","Id":260326,"Name":"loviesbee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c599cd02d5097deec6a66ab8a4242c40","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yay! Congrats! &lt;span alt=\":cheer2:\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1350668914688_887\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"43\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1350668914688_886\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" width=\"55\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;This website has been great and so has my TA! If you don&#039;t have a travel agent that works with destination weddings get yourself one ASAP they are a HUGE help and a plus if they have already worked with Hard Rock because the communication with them leaves a lot to be desired. I am glad I am not the only 2014 bride at the hard rock on here! Have you seen the 2014 rates yet? They seem&amp;nbsp;high i am keeping my fingers crossed that they go down a little bit! Did you chose your collection or any other details yet?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1676433,"PostDate":1350669092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yay! Congrats! <span alt=\":cheer2:\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1350668914688_887\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"43\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1350668914688_886\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" width=\"55\" \/><\/span><\/span>This website has been great and so has my TA! If you don't have a travel agent that works with destination weddings get yourself one ASAP they are a HUGE help and a plus if they have already worked with Hard Rock because the communication with them leaves a lot to be desired. I am glad I am not the only 2014 bride at the hard rock on here! Have you seen the 2014 rates yet? They seem\u00a0high i am keeping my fingers crossed that they go down a little bit! Did you chose your collection or any other details yet?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0d82627887cf6999ebe3a8b6167dcc9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am strongly considering HR as my resort for my wedding.&amp;nbsp; I wanted to get married on May 18, 2014, but found out that it could only be a symbolic ceremony.&lt;span alt=\":(\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_885\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_884\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; I have moved it to the 17th instead.&amp;nbsp; I have gotten some good information from the resort.&amp;nbsp; What wedding packages are you ladies looking at, if any? What made you choose this resort over others?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats and Happy Planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1678653,"PostDate":1351181225,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am strongly considering HR as my resort for my wedding.\u00a0 I wanted to get married on May 18, 2014, but found out that it could only be a symbolic ceremony.<span alt=\":(\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_885\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_884\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span>\u00a0 I have moved it to the 17th instead.\u00a0 I have gotten some good information from the resort.\u00a0 What wedding packages are you ladies looking at, if any? What made you choose this resort over others?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats and Happy Planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sharon610ron@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1348977729,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260865.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sbowie","Id":260865,"Name":"sbowie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c417839be0cc07873dd8e86a96ca7dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies!!! Hope all is going well with wedding planning! SBOWIE i chose hard rock because it is a larger resort, child friendly, and has plenty to do for all ages. Their food was very very good when i went and stayed there and the rooms were spotless and beautiful. I didn&#039;t see a reason to even look at any other resorts once i seen the hard rock in person. I am looking to do the elegant ivory collection but I&#039;m trying to see if i can get one of the older collections or work with the decor company to do something on my own. I seen the purple shimmer in person it is VERY pretty but i just didn&#039;t want to do purple for my wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any other 2014 Hard rock brides out there? &lt;span alt=\":welcome:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1357669650618_864\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"45\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1357669650618_863\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome.gif\" width=\"60\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1702536,"PostDate":1357669857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies!!! Hope all is going well with wedding planning! SBOWIE i chose hard rock because it is a larger resort, child friendly, and has plenty to do for all ages. Their food was very very good when i went and stayed there and the rooms were spotless and beautiful. I didn't see a reason to even look at any other resorts once i seen the hard rock in person. I am looking to do the elegant ivory collection but I'm trying to see if i can get one of the older collections or work with the decor company to do something on my own. I seen the purple shimmer in person it is VERY pretty but i just didn't want to do purple for my wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any other 2014 Hard rock brides out there? <span alt=\":welcome:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1357669650618_864\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"45\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1357669650618_863\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome.gif\" width=\"60\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6335a119a2ecfab4ed392bd019b99900","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any Hard Rock Hotel Experts out there? &amp;nbsp;We are looking for someone to be the&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides\"&gt;Hard Rock Hotel Ambassado&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;r.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Help new brides thinking of getting married at HR, promote the resort, and earn free nights while you do it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Link here for more info: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard Rock Hotels Ambassador&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1702715,"PostDate":1357689600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any Hard Rock Hotel Experts out there? \u00a0We are looking for someone to be the<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong> <\/strong><\/a><strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides' class='bbc_url' title=''>Hard Rock Hotel Ambassado<\/a><\/strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>r.<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0Help new brides thinking of getting married at HR, promote the resort, and earn free nights while you do it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Link here for more info: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/83910\/calling-all-past-present-hard-rock-hotel-brides' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>Hard Rock Hotels Ambassador<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1f0f4df90cf5bed05fe80cb65324435","RawContent":"Hi ladies, The fi and i are 95% sure that HRPC is the resort in which we will be having our wedding. Weare planning on havingit march 2014","Attachments":[],"Id":1709194,"PostDate":1358808250,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies, The fi and i are 95% sure that HRPC is the resort in which we will be having our wedding. Weare planning on havingit march 2014\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"evbaez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.220.246.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345071025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259212.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"evbaez","Id":259212,"Name":"evbaez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b5bafb549e7dcd075bbbe6fb0b1ab5f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you Megamarie3 for that info.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709636,"PostDate":1358878644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you Megamarie3 for that info.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"evbaez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.220.246.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345071025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259212.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"evbaez","Id":259212,"Name":"evbaez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b457a34990061528d3220fa17e640e86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello fellow 2014 Brides! I so excited we&#039;ve decided on the HRPC and getting married January 15, 2014!&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1358988815326_1732\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;I must agree with everyone else, this website has been a life saver! The one thing I&#039;m wondering about and if anyone can help me with is hair and make-up. I&#039;m not going to be able to bring my hair dresser or make-up artist and I totally inept with both. So, I was wondering if any bride used the HRPC&#039;s hair stylist and\/or make-up artist and if so, what did they think and who (if they where really good). Thanks!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1710417,"PostDate":1358989165,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello fellow 2014 Brides! I so excited we've decided on the HRPC and getting married January 15, 2014!\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1358988815326_1732\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span>\u00a0I must agree with everyone else, this website has been a life saver! The one thing I'm wondering about and if anyone can help me with is hair and make-up. I'm not going to be able to bring my hair dresser or make-up artist and I totally inept with both. So, I was wondering if any bride used the HRPC's hair stylist and\/or make-up artist and if so, what did they think and who (if they where really good). Thanks!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelaricher@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357943503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264279.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngieRich","Id":264279,"Name":"AngieRich","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5eaa19cc1a9477841c62fa04436e047d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AngieRich[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello fellow 2014 Brides! I so excited we&#039;ve decided on the HRPC and getting married January 15, 2014! [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif[\/img] I must agree with everyone else, this website has been a life saver! The one thing I&#039;m wondering about and if anyone can help me with is hair and make-up. I&#039;m not going to be able to bring my hair dresser or make-up artist and I totally inept with both. So, I was wondering if any bride used the HRPC&#039;s hair stylist and\/or make-up artist and if so, what did they think and who (if they where really good). Thanks![\/quote] \n Hi AngieRich!!! I am getting married March 8th 2014 so im happy to see youll be there a few months before me!!! My biggest mistake was not trying the salon out when i went for my site visit. You might want to check the other Hard Rock board with 2012 brides and see if they were happy with them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1710822,"PostDate":1359060935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AngieRich<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello fellow 2014 Brides! I so excited we've decided on the HRPC and getting married January 15, 2014!\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1358988815326_1732\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span>\u00a0I must agree with everyone else, this website has been a life saver! The one thing I'm wondering about and if anyone can help me with is hair and make-up. I'm not going to be able to bring my hair dresser or make-up artist and I totally inept with both. So, I was wondering if any bride used the HRPC's hair stylist and\/or make-up artist and if so, what did they think and who (if they where really good). Thanks!\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hi AngieRich!!! I am getting married March 8th 2014 so im happy to see youll be there a few months before me!!! My biggest mistake was not trying the salon out when i went for my site visit. You might want to check the other Hard Rock board with 2012 brides and see if they were happy with them.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"69910","Title":"2014 Hard Rock Punta Cana DR Brides!","LastPostDate":1431314992},"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
