p for \"All Classy Palace Resorts\/Hard Rock Brides Past, Present, and Future\" can someone post the link?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1712630,"PostDate":1359407916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I cannot find the facebook group for \"All Classy Palace Resorts\/Hard Rock Brides Past, Present, and Future\" can someone post the link?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jboa0524@brockport.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1356817528,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263626.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"J4jenn4","Id":263626,"Name":"J4jenn4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01e67d64ea05dc735894ebbadc7286b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m still waiting, my TA says the rates aren&#039;t out yet, hopefully, the rates will be out by Feb. Has any gotten rates, the rates online look pricey, $405 for 2013 and $500 for 2014, but this is off of the HRPC website. Keep us posted on the rates. Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713181,"PostDate":1359505872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm still waiting, my TA says the rates aren't out yet, hopefully, the rates will be out by Feb. Has any gotten rates, the rates online look pricey, $405 for 2013 and $500 for 2014, but this is off of the HRPC website. Keep us posted on the rates. Thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelaricher@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357943503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264279.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngieRich","Id":264279,"Name":"AngieRich","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
