{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f11877474222788e86db90833fc9f48","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;Good evening ladies!&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;I hope that you don&#039;t mind an active groom sharing in on the excitement! My&amp;nbsp; fiancee and I will be getting married at the HRPC on January 18, 2014! I have to admit that although we were first in contact with the resort in October we are just having our call with Jennifer this week. Our first WP left the organization and we were left in limbo although she had reserved our date for us. But we have moved on and look forward to working with Jennifer. She has been very responsive so far and we feel comfortable with her.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;We have received prices from our travel agent in early December and&amp;nbsp;they seem to be remaining consistent.&amp;nbsp;We are coming out of the northeast so we expected&amp;nbsp;it to be pricey. I plan to keep active here and my fiancee found a FB page today that someone mentioned earlier so we will both be researching!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;Hopefully our call goes as well as planned and we will be ready to get things moving forward.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;K&amp;amp;B&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713278,"PostDate":1359515198,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Good evening ladies!\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">I hope that you don't mind an active groom sharing in on the excitement! My\u00a0 fiancee and I will be getting married at the HRPC on January 18, 2014! I have to admit that although we were first in contact with the resort in October we are just having our call with Jennifer this week. Our first WP left the organization and we were left in limbo although she had reserved our date for us. But we have moved on and look forward to working with Jennifer. She has been very responsive so far and we feel comfortable with her.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">We have received prices from our travel agent in early December and\u00a0they seem to be remaining consistent.\u00a0We are coming out of the northeast so we expected\u00a0it to be pricey. I plan to keep active here and my fiancee found a FB page today that someone mentioned earlier so we will both be researching!<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Hopefully our call goes as well as planned and we will be ready to get things moving forward.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">K&B<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ccff869118144be4ff32b3145a60a1c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\"&gt;Yes, we did a group rate thru our normal travel agent. We will get benefits from our group number and we will also get perks from HR due to the number of people that we will be hosting.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713295,"PostDate":1359515959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 205)\">Yes, we did a group rate thru our normal travel agent. We will get benefits from our group number and we will also get perks from HR due to the number of people that we will be hosting.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2bbbede948181e5ef9257d993c887360","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KerriAnn5[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Evbaez! I am getting married at HRPC March 8th 2014! yay! Did you book yet?[\/quote] \n Hi KerriAnn5 \n \n The fiance and I  decided to change resorts last minute. We are getting married at the Majestic Elegance March 2014. I found the rates to be a little pricy at the HRPC.","Attachments":[],"Id":1713642,"PostDate":1359577316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KerriAnn5<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Evbaez! I am getting married at HRPC March 8th 2014! yay! Did you book yet?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hi KerriAnn5<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The fiance and I \u00a0decided to change resorts last minute. We are getting married at the Majestic Elegance March 2014. I found the rates to be a little pricy at the HRPC.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"evbaez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.220.246.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345071025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259212.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"evbaez","Id":259212,"Name":"evbaez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25fd707dccbe45c70b968a7ad04c6f14","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Booked for Feb 2014!!! Is anyone else working with Mia Mendoza? I&#039;m guessing that she&#039;s new to the Miami office since I haven&#039;t heard about her before, so far so good as she is very quick to respond to all my emails.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713746,"PostDate":1359591295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Booked for Feb 2014!!! Is anyone else working with Mia Mendoza? I'm guessing that she's new to the Miami office since I haven't heard about her before, so far so good as she is very quick to respond to all my emails.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.camille@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.77.181.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350343914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261397.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alycamille","Id":261397,"Name":"alycamille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"637f2fc2d330a8f3dd6e5375ee03f07c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My first post! We have finally booked for February 2014!!! So excited! Does anyone else have Mia Mendoza as their coordinator? I&#039;m guessing that she is new to the Miami office as I haven&#039;t heard about her before.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713748,"PostDate":1359591439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My first post! We have finally booked for February 2014!!! So excited! Does anyone else have Mia Mendoza as their coordinator? I'm guessing that she is new to the Miami office as I haven't heard about her before.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.camille@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.77.181.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350343914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261397.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alycamille","Id":261397,"Name":"alycamille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ccaac935ed8d0ab5341a3f99a35e5b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My first post! We have finally booked for Feb 2014!!! Does anyone else have Mia Mendoza as their coordinator? I&#039;m guessing she&#039;s new to the Miami office since I haven&#039;t heard anything about her before.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713749,"PostDate":1359591527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My first post! We have finally booked for Feb 2014!!! Does anyone else have Mia Mendoza as their coordinator? I'm guessing she's new to the Miami office since I haven't heard anything about her before.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.camille@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.77.181.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350343914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261397.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alycamille","Id":261397,"Name":"alycamille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62e86351379081b552ebdf94e9763acc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I did receive my group rate trough my Travel Agent and the groups rate is pretty good I am very Happy with it!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I do know some of my guest will be booking their travel on their own and the rates are not out yet online!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713988,"PostDate":1359646857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi!<\/p> <p> I did receive my group rate trough my Travel Agent and the groups rate is pretty good I am very Happy with it!\u00a0<\/p> <p> I do know some of my guest will be booking their travel on their own and the rates are not out yet online!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kiki_2289@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.5.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351909285,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262025.jpg?_r=1407945054","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kiki2289","Id":262025,"Name":"kiki2289","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fcf7ca5ffb9db3f4f811eb2852763fb","RawContent":"Hi! I am also planning my wedding for February 2014. I just had my first call with Jennifer. Does anyone know of any sites that have real wedding photos? Or photos from the resort photographer?","Attachments":[],"Id":1714272,"PostDate":1359678680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! I am also planning my wedding for February 2014. I just had my first call with Jennifer. Does anyone know of any sites that have real wedding photos? Or photos from the resort photographer?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tonder.kristen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359678400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265459.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ktonder","Id":265459,"Name":"Ktonder","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97ceb71cb0cf0bf776627fa175357b45","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Ktonder[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi! I am also planning my wedding for February 2014. I just had my first call with Jennifer. Does anyone know of any sites that have real wedding photos? Or photos from the resort photographer?[\/quote] \n Hi Ktonder! If you go on the hard rock website they have the 360 view photos which are great. Also if you google it you will probably be able to find some. The resport is so beautiful i did my site visit in Setpember and I am booked for March 8th 2014. I lost my camera while i was there so i didn&#039;t get to take to many photos but let me know if you want info on a specific site ill tell you about it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1714913,"PostDate":1359817070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Ktonder<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi! I am also planning my wedding for February 2014. I just had my first call with Jennifer. Does anyone know of any sites that have real wedding photos? Or photos from the resort photographer?<\/blockquote> <p> Hi Ktonder! If you go on the hard rock website they have the 360 view photos which are great. Also if you google it you will probably be able to find some. The resport is so beautiful i did my site visit in Setpember and I am booked for March 8th 2014. I lost my camera while i was there so i didn't get to take to many photos but let me know if you want info on a specific site ill tell you about it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5fda0dc7cc7fb05d90a619e7563567c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]evbaez[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi KerriAnn5 \n \n The fiance and I  decided to change resorts last minute. We are getting married at the Majestic Elegance March 2014. I found the rates to be a little pricy at the HRPC.[\/quote] \n I have stayed at the Majestic Elegance as well and its very nice! Your wedding will be beautiful good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1714914,"PostDate":1359817121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>evbaez<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi KerriAnn5<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The fiance and I \u00a0decided to change resorts last minute. We are getting married at the Majestic Elegance March 2014. I found the rates to be a little pricy at the HRPC.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I have stayed at the Majestic Elegance as well and its very nice! Your wedding will be beautiful good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
