{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"323635271aa001fb6f3c7e2233637272","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Lotty2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=4][color=#0000FF]Good evening ladies!  [\/color][\/size] \n \n [size=4][color=#0000FF]I hope that you don&#039;t mind an active groom sharing in on the excitement! My  fiancee and I will be getting married at the HRPC on January 18, 2014! I have to admit that although we were first in contact with the resort in October we are just having our call with Jennifer this week. Our first WP left the organization and we were left in limbo although she had reserved our date for us. But we have moved on and look forward to working with Jennifer. She has been very responsive so far and we feel comfortable with her.[\/color][\/size] \n \n [size=4][color=#0000FF]We have received prices from our travel agent in early December and they seem to be remaining consistent. We are coming out of the northeast so we expected it to be pricey. I plan to keep active here and my fiancee found a FB page today that someone mentioned earlier so we will both be researching![\/color][\/size] \n \n [size=4][color=#0000FF]Hopefully our call goes as well as planned and we will be ready to get things moving forward.[\/color][\/size] \n \n [size=4][color=#0000FF]K&amp;amp;B[\/color][\/size][\/quote] \n welcome lotty!! I booked my wedding for March 8th 2014 and we are also coming from the north east. I booked a group rate with my TA and they dont seem to be to bad with the pricing. The resport is worth it i did my site visit in September. Good luck with everything!","Attachments":[],"Id":1714916,"PostDate":1359817278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Lotty2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Good evening ladies!\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">I hope that you don't mind an active groom sharing in on the excitement! My\u00a0 fiancee and I will be getting married at the HRPC on January 18, 2014! I have to admit that although we were first in contact with the resort in October we are just having our call with Jennifer this week. Our first WP left the organization and we were left in limbo although she had reserved our date for us. But we have moved on and look forward to working with Jennifer. She has been very responsive so far and we feel comfortable with her.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">We have received prices from our travel agent in early December and\u00a0they seem to be remaining consistent.\u00a0We are coming out of the northeast so we expected\u00a0it to be pricey. I plan to keep active here and my fiancee found a FB page today that someone mentioned earlier so we will both be researching!<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Hopefully our call goes as well as planned and we will be ready to get things moving forward.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">K&B<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> welcome lotty!! I booked my wedding for March 8th 2014 and we are also coming from the north east. I booked a group rate with my TA and they dont seem to be to bad with the pricing. The resport is worth it i did my site visit in September. Good luck with everything!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35bdf79fb535c6f5ef14be6f0d257c8b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KerriAnn5\"]\nHi Ktonder! If you go on the hard rock website they have the 360 view photos which are great. Also if you google it you will probably be able to find some. The resport is so beautiful i did my site visit in Setpember and I am booked for March 8th 2014. I lost my camera while i was there so i didn&#039;t get to take to many photos but let me know if you want info on a specific site ill tell you about it![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1715331,"PostDate":1359914926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"KerriAnn5\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides#post_1864481\"><p>Hi Ktonder! If you go on the hard rock website they have the 360 view photos which are great. Also if you google it you will probably be able to find some. The resport is so beautiful i did my site visit in Setpember and I am booked for March 8th 2014. I lost my camera while i was there so i didn't get to take to many photos but let me know if you want info on a specific site ill tell you about it!<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tonder.kristen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359678400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265459.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ktonder","Id":265459,"Name":"Ktonder","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62295266b48ce618a9c1cc2b75b91672","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Ktonder\"][\/quote] Hi KerriAnn5! Do you know where on the site I can find the 360 views? I can&#039;t seem to find them. I&#039;m also wondering where we can have private functions. On one form I see beach, terrace, garden and ballroom listed. Are pools available too? Do you have any pictures of the terraces and gardens? I&#039;m so happy to be able to ask questions to someone who has been there! Thank you for your help!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1715337,"PostDate":1359915181,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Ktonder\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides#post_1864899\"><p><\/p><\/blockquote> Hi KerriAnn5! Do you know where on the site I can find the 360 views? I can't seem to find them. I'm also wondering where we can have private functions. On one form I see beach, terrace, garden and ballroom listed. Are pools available too? Do you have any pictures of the terraces and gardens? I'm so happy to be able to ask questions to someone who has been there! Thank you for your help!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tonder.kristen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359678400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265459.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ktonder","Id":265459,"Name":"Ktonder","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b95754b04c2ca9d6b7804da61911a966","RawContent":"&lt;h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_569\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; Hello Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Brides and Grooms,&lt;\/h2&gt; &lt;h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_805\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; Just a reminder that we posted the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84211\/hard-rock-all-inclusive-resorts-wedding-webinar-sat-february-23-2013-9-00am-pst\"&gt;registration information for the Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Wedding Webinar Scheduled for Saturday, February 23, 2013 @ 9:00am PST.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt; &lt;h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_607\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; This will be a great webinar where you can learn about the new wedding packages as well as get your wedding questions answered!&lt;\/h2&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715927,"PostDate":1360006826,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_569\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> Hello Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Brides and Grooms,<\/h2> <h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_805\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> Just a reminder that we posted the\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84211\/hard-rock-all-inclusive-resorts-wedding-webinar-sat-february-23-2013-9-00am-pst' class='bbc_url' title=''>registration information for the Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Wedding Webinar Scheduled for Saturday, February 23, 2013 @ 9:00am PST.<\/a><\/h2> <h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_607\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> This will be a great webinar where you can learn about the new wedding packages as well as get your wedding questions answered!<\/h2>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"919e15f16a6c1fd8be558994d3102f2d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; what if i cant make the webinar? will you post questions and answers?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1718907,"PostDate":1360525103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> what if i cant make the webinar? will you post questions and answers?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"enz_83@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"99.237.93.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358120363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264367.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":18