teDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87dc6893729bd68a593eb05346552a42","RawContent":"Hi eclipse wasn&#039;t available I got element terrace anyone with previous experience with that one?","Attachments":[],"Id":1724551,"PostDate":1361575819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi eclipse wasn't available I got element terrace anyone with previous experience with that one?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kiki_2289@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.5.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351909285,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262025.jpg?_r=1407945054","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kiki2289","Id":262025,"Name":"kiki2289","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29b0ed41b31b691ddb664e58573dc830","RawContent":"&lt;h4 id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1357\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(97, 95, 90); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; I have some exciting news to share. &amp;nbsp;We have been given 50% off on Colin Cowie Collections for those that attend the webinar and book a new wedding with Wright Travel Agency.&lt;\/h4&gt; &lt;h4 id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1355\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(97, 95, 90); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/h4&gt; &lt;h4 id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1350\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(97, 95, 90); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; It is only 1 package per resort and will be first come, first served. &amp;nbsp;Details will be on the webinar, you can&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1353\" style=\"font-style: inherit;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84211\/hard-rock-all-inclusive-resorts-wedding-webinar-sat-february-23-2013-9-00am-pst\"&gt;register in the first post here.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h4&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1724610,"PostDate":1361591817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <h4 id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1357\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(97, 95, 90); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> I have some exciting news to share. \u00a0We have been given 50% off on Colin Cowie Collections for those that attend the webinar and book a new wedding with Wright Travel Agency.<\/h4> <h4 id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1355\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(97, 95, 90); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> \u00a0<\/h4> <h4 id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1350\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(97, 95, 90); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> It is only 1 package per resort and will be first come, first served. \u00a0Details will be on the webinar, you can\u00a0<strong id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361591598486_1353\" style=\"font-style: inherit;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84211\/hard-rock-all-inclusive-resorts-wedding-webinar-sat-february-23-2013-9-00am-pst' class='bbc_url' title=''>register in the first post here.<\/a><\/strong><\/h4>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d1511c61b8a6acbcf6d42a89c9d30f6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kiki2289[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi eclipse wasn&#039;t available I got element terrace anyone with previous experience with that one?[\/quote] \n \n Hi Kiki! I have seen both in person and the element terrace has a GREAT view of the beach. I went with the eclipse only because i have elderly and guest who can not climb steps and eclipse has a staircase. Did anyone send you photos of it?","Attachments":[],"Id":1729297,"PostDate":1362505449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kiki2289<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi eclipse wasn't available I got element terrace anyone with previous experience with that one?<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi Kiki! I have seen both in person and the element terrace has a GREAT view of the beach. I went with the eclipse only because i have elderly and guest who can not climb steps and eclipse has a staircase. Did anyone send you photos of it?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b356bfe484e54e4dd48c7d280e14e46d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Ktonder[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi KerriAnn5!\n \n Do you know where on the site I can find the 360 views? I can&#039;t seem to find them. I&#039;m also wondering where we can have private functions. On one form I see beach, terrace, garden and ballroom listed. Are pools available too? Do you have any pictures of the terraces and gardens?\n \n I&#039;m so happy to be able to ask questions to someone who has been there! Thank you for your help!![\/quote] \n I was able to get the eden pool for my welcome party, The eclipse terrace for my cocktail party and the ballroom for my reception. If you e mail your wedding coordinator they can tell you what sites are available for the day your getting married. I THINK there is more than one pool to chose from for your function Also, Here is the link to the site with the photos \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.hardrockhotelpuntacana.com\/hotel-photogallery.aspx\"]http:\/\/www.hardrockhotelpuntacana.com\/hotel-photogallery.aspx[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1729305,"PostDate":1362505696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Ktonder<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Hi KerriAnn5!<br \/> <br \/> Do you know where on the site I can find the 360 views? I can't seem to find them. I'm also wondering where we can have private functions. On one form I see beach, terrace, garden and ballroom listed. Are pools available too? Do you have any pictures of the terraces and gardens?<br \/> <br \/> I'm so happy to be able to ask questions to someone who has been there! Thank you for your help!!<\/blockquote> <p> I was able to get the eden pool for my welcome party, The eclipse terrace for my cocktail party and the ballroom for my reception. If you e mail your wedding coordinator they can tell you what sites are available for the day your getting married. I THINK there is\u00a0more than one pool to chose from for your function Also, Here is the link to the site with the photos<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.hardrockhotelpuntacana.com\/hotel-photogallery.aspx' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.hardrockh...otogallery.aspx<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
