Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f4da16a1d49a1c2b38c601383923410","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I see a few February 2014 brides any March brides out there yet? One year ladies and gentleman!!! How is everyone doing with the wedding coordinators? I am working with Lisa and she responds to all of my questions via e mail pretty quickly. I am just confused on what type of decor i want for my reception in the ballroom. Is anyone else having a ballroom reception?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1729315,"PostDate":1362506094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I see a few February 2014 brides any March brides out there yet? One year ladies and gentleman!!! How is everyone doing with the wedding coordinators? I am working with Lisa and she responds to all of my questions via e mail pretty quickly. I am just confused on what type of decor i want for my reception in the ballroom. Is anyone else having a ballroom reception?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f594b07e40a9de57ffe066854df25bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies and gents&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am new to the site and planning to get married @ HRPC June 2014..... very nervous because we have never been and have heard such MIXED&amp;nbsp; reviews.. I have read reviews on trip advisor and they really slam HRPC.. Havent been able to really read a review from a bride that actually been married there and thats a little scary!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1730266,"PostDate":1362618707,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies and gents<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am new to the site and planning to get married @ HRPC June 2014..... very nervous because we have never been and have heard such MIXED\u00a0 reviews.. I have read reviews on trip advisor and they really slam HRPC.. Havent been able to really read a review from a bride that actually been married there and thats a little scary!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"onelilndn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362584519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266964.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"onelilndn","Id":266964,"Name":"onelilndn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5ab5b5b7d54c495a1850e31f2c0c491","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies! I am a newbie to the sites! I am in the process of booking Hard Rock for June 2014. Renee just sent me the contract and I am reading absolutely everything three times! LOL I am so&amp;nbsp;excited! This site is a GOD send!! I have so may questions and concerns. Does anyone else have more than 30 people? What happens if you use a travel agency, can you still get the free reception for more than 30 people if you book 20-25 rooms? Does anyone know? Also are there other questions or deals I should be asking for?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1731105,"PostDate":1362763899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies! I am a newbie to the sites! I am in the process of booking Hard Rock for June 2014. Renee just sent me the contract and I am reading absolutely everything three times! LOL I am so\u00a0excited! This site is a GOD send!! I have so may questions and concerns. Does anyone else have more than 30 people? What happens if you use a travel agency, can you still get the free reception for more than 30 people if you book 20-25 rooms? Does anyone know? Also are there other questions or deals I should be asking for?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"raylovessheila@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361815271,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266571.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":112,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sheila Farmer","Id":266571,"Name":"Sheila Farmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a1cf0ad8d9744322283ac174baab80b","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Sheila Farmer[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi ladies! I am a newbie to the sites! I am in the process of booking Hard Rock for June 2014. Renee just sent me the contract and I am reading absolutely everything three times! LOL I am so excited! This site is a GOD send!! I have so may questions and concerns. Does anyone else have more than 30 people? What happens if you use a travel agency, can you still get the free reception for more than 30 people if you book 20-25 rooms? Does anyone know? Also are there other questions or deals I should be asking for?[\/quote] \n Hi Sheila! I have more than 30 people. I went through a travel agent and they were able to give me a contract. My wedding coordinator Lisa confirmed that yes i will still be eligible for the free reception as long as they have all the confirmations for the booked rooms.Just so you are aware you get 2 three hour private functions for free. I had Renee as my wedding coordinator and it was switched to Lisa recently. Best advise i have for you is if you have any questions compile them into an e mail and send it to them. They will respond and keep record of everything they tell you!! They change things last minute on you and unless you have that e mail they wont honor it. CONGRATS! and enjoy wedding planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1731161,"PostDate":1362769354,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sheila Farmer<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi ladies! I am a newbie to the sites! I am in the process of booking Hard Rock for June 2014. Renee just sent me the contract and I am reading absolutely everything three times! LOL I am so\u00a0excited! This site is a GOD send!! I have so may questions and concerns. Does anyone else have more than 30 people? What happens if you use a travel agency, can you still get the free reception for more than 30 people if you book 20-25 rooms? Does anyone know? Also are there other questions or deals I should be asking for?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hi Sheila! I have more than 30 people. I went through a travel agent and they were able to give me a contract. My wedding coordinator Lisa confirmed that yes i will still be eligible for the free reception as long as they have all the confirmations for the booked rooms.Just so you are aware you get 2 three hour private functions for free. I had Renee as my wedding\u00a0coordinator and it was switched to Lisa recently. Best advise i have for you is if you have any questions compile them into an e mail and send it to them. They will respond and keep record of everything they tell you!! They change things last minute on you and unless you have that e mail they wont honor it. CONGRATS! and enjoy wedding planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b768489cd3e2e3461ac830f2153b780","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]onelilndn[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey ladies and gents \n \n I am new to the site and planning to get married @ HRPC June 2014..... very nervous because we have never been and have heard such MIXED  reviews.. I have read reviews on trip advisor and they really slam HRPC.. Havent been able to really read a review from a bride that actually been married there and thats a little scary![\/quote] \n I wasnt married there YET but i did stay at this resort in September and have not one complaint. We had a great time and ended up canceling our other site visits and just booked the wedding at the hard rock","Attachments":[],"Id":1731163,"PostDate":1362769523,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>onelilndn<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey ladies and gents<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am new to the site and planning to get married @ HRPC June 2014..... very nervous because we have never been and have heard such MIXED\u00a0 reviews.. I have read reviews on trip advisor and they really slam HRPC.. Havent been able to really read a review from a bride that actually been married there and thats a little scary!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I wasnt married there YET but i did stay at this resort in September and have not one complaint. We had a great time and ended up canceling our other site visits and just booked the wedding at the hard rock<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81f4294767e558d2729061de05ade0fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks for the info.. so so nervous to book site un seen... such an important day&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1732980,"PostDate":1363146898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks for the info.. so so nervous to book site un seen... such an important day<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"onelilndn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362584519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266964.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"onelilndn","Id":266964,"Name":"onelilndn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbc973de5d96abd985d397525b6de876","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anyone have pictures of the different pools for reception areas? I have seen many pictures but none with names (other than the eden pool)...Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1734616,"PostDate":1363455211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anyone have pictures of the different pools for reception areas? I have seen many pictures but none with names (other than the eden pool)...Thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tonder.kristen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359678400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265459.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ktonder","Id":265459,"Name":"Ktonder","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33b3406fdad7b008c2fd33f8c69074b6","RawContent":"Hi I&#039;m new here also and am planning a January 2014 wedding at the HRPC as well, I&#039;m very excited!! Has anyone had any experience with the photographers there? I&#039;m not sure if I should go through the hotel or use someone that is independant?? Any feedback would be great :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1734641,"PostDate":1363459906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi I'm new here also and am planning a January 2014 wedding at the HRPC as well, I'm very excited!! Has anyone had any experience with the photographers there? I'm not sure if I should go through the hotel or use someone that is independant?? Any feedback would be great <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessicastatz13@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363458617,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267429.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessijean13","Id":267429,"Name":"jessijean13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1bf3e6ae6c088b872d1090d672a7e23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello 2014 Brides!! I just got my contract from Mia in the Miami office, she seems pretty responsive. I will have my teleconference with her soon and beginning to compile my list of questions. Any suggestions on questions, I just want to make sure that I don&#039;t miss anything :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1734672,"PostDate":1363468544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello 2014 Brides!! I just got my contract from Mia in the Miami office, she seems pretty responsive. I will have my teleconference with her soon and beginning to compile my list of questions. Any suggestions on questions, I just want to make sure that I don't miss anything <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelaricher@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357943503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264279.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngieRich","Id":264279,"Name":"AngieRich","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f43b6d4afc1ea9e2305944eff0cb219","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies!! Another HRPC bride here! My fiance and I are getting Married May 3, 2014!! We are in the process of reviewing the contract and booking our date!! SO excited! Does anyone have any pics of the areas actually decorated? My TA sent me a pdf from HRPC with the reception locations and ceremony locations. If anyone needs those, I&#039;ll be glad to email them to you! Have a great day!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736838,"PostDate":1363900162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies!! Another HRPC bride here! My fiance and I are getting Married May 3, 2014!! We are in the process of reviewing the contract and booking our date!! SO excited! Does anyone have any pics of the areas actually decorated? My TA sent me a pdf from HRPC with the reception locations and ceremony locations. If anyone needs those, I'll be glad to email them to you! Have a great day!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dnrichmond@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362069158,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266687.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"curlygirlnpearl","Id":266687,"Name":"curlygirlnpearl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
