{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44312db51f4cbf3d7136bb3674e6095e","RawContent":"Hi ladies ... Can I join you please :) me &amp; my OH are getting married in June 2014 but not able to set a date yet as the prices havnt been released! I&#039;m so excited. I stayed at the hard rock for 2 weeks in September 2011 and its amazing!!! Loved every second xx","Attachments":[],"Id":1740215,"PostDate":1364627706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies ... Can I join you please <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> me & my OH are getting married in June 2014 but not able to set a date yet as the prices havnt been released! I'm so excited. I stayed at the hard rock for 2 weeks in September 2011 and its amazing!!! Loved every second xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicola.nutt@student.manchester.ac.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364627471,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267966.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"isaacsmummy2012","Id":267966,"Name":"isaacsmummy2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f1fdbb51f8fe35488eb9aabaf28952f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; If you contact the wedding group coordinators they can get you group pricing for 2014, My wedding is in August and I already have my contract with prices.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1741088,"PostDate":1364906599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> If you contact the wedding group coordinators they can get you group pricing for 2014, My wedding is in August and I already have my contract with prices.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1430657102","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9dbeeb7329741c56b127232fe75262b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We have 2014 rates for Hard Rock Punta Cana and w&lt;span style=\"background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal;\"&gt;e also Specialize in Destination weddings and Hard Rock Properties. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_657\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_655\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; You can contact us:  &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\"&gt;&lt;strong id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_653\" style=\"font-style: inherit;\"&gt;Contact a Destination Wedding Specialist HERE&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with some dates and we can get some 2014 rates to you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_671\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_673\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"font-style: inherit;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\"&gt;You can read some of our reviews here:&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\"&gt;Wright Travel Agency ~ Destination Wedding Specialist Reviews HERE&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1741173,"PostDate":1364921738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We have 2014 rates for Hard Rock Punta Cana and w<span  style=\"background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">e also Specialize in Destination weddings and Hard Rock Properties. \u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_657\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_655\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> You can contact us:\u00a0\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_653\" style=\"font-style: inherit;\">Contact a Destination Wedding Specialist HERE<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0with some dates and we can get some 2014 rates to you.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_671\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364921663881_673\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> <strong style=\"font-style: inherit;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34)\">You can read some of our reviews here:<\/span>\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists' class='bbc_url' title=''>Wright Travel Agency ~ Destination Wedding Specialist Reviews HERE<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff99a9e1ef7e8e36c6a8b1609791c6df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I will be staying at HRPC in two weeks. &amp;nbsp;If anyone needs pics or information of anything specific let me know and I will try to get it for you while I&#039;m there. &amp;nbsp;I did not get married at HRPC, but I did get married in Dominican Republic in 2011. &amp;nbsp;Happy to help any way possible. &amp;nbsp;I can make many recommendations for the Punta Cana area. &amp;nbsp;Can also share pics of our DIY welcome bagsand ceremony programs. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742389,"PostDate":1365164419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I will be staying at HRPC in two weeks. \u00a0If anyone needs pics or information of anything specific let me know and I will try to get it for you while I'm there. \u00a0I did not get married at HRPC, but I did get married in Dominican Republic in 2011. \u00a0Happy to help any way possible. \u00a0I can make many recommendations for the Punta Cana area. \u00a0Can also share pics of our DIY welcome bagsand ceremony programs. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kellys8525@gmail.com","IpAddress":"186.7.250.139","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309623758,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241872.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DRBride11","Id":241872,"Name":"DRBride11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89008681674ebae0b7a3d25f7f7e5099","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; DRBride11- So glad you are going!!!&amp;nbsp; I have been putting off signing my contract because I am so nervous!&amp;nbsp; The past several reviews I have seen online read like horror stories on customer service.&amp;nbsp; I would be thrilled to get your opinion on how they do.&amp;nbsp; The last thing I want is to have my family and friends show up for my wedding and have them service be horrible.&amp;nbsp; They have also said that all the pools except the Eden pool are looking a little run down, would you mind taking pics of a few of them?&amp;nbsp; Thanks so much!!&amp;nbsp;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742390,"PostDate":1365164819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> DRBride11- So glad you are going!!!\u00a0 I have been putting off signing my contract because I am so nervous!\u00a0 The past several reviews I have seen online read like horror stories on customer service.\u00a0 I would be thrilled to get your opinion on how they do.\u00a0 The last thing I want is to have my family and friends show up for my wedding and have them service be horrible.\u00a0 They have also said that all the pools except the Eden pool are looking a little run down, would you mind taking pics of a few of them?\u00a0 Thanks so much!!\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1430657102","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a702dcae2d0fb8dbf715ec89f559be33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; would love any info you could share.. and since your already married you know what to look for.&amp;nbsp; I look forward to reading your reviews... thanks for all the info in advance&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742486,"PostDate":1365182031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> would love any info you could share.. and since your already married you know what to look for.\u00a0 I look forward to reading your reviews... thanks for all the info in advance<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"onelilndn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362584519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266964.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"onelilndn","Id":266964,"Name":"onelilndn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a2ca1a6e63b9419a9acd078802d06aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; HRPC brides got a big shout out with this Hard Rock background! Looks incredible to me ... wish I was going to Punta Cana!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742493,"PostDate":1365183233,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HRPC brides got a big shout out with this Hard Rock background! Looks incredible to me ... wish I was going to Punta Cana!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanie@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":78,"GroupName":"Huddler","JoinDate":1277160158,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229392.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":280,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GauchoSteph","Id":229392,"Name":"GauchoSteph","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3906fb174fa5d1825a7e1fc046e3564c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; will do!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742618,"PostDate":1365206903,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> will do!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kellys8525@gmail.com","IpAddress":"186.7.250.139","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309623758,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241872.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DRBride11","Id":241872,"Name":"DRBride11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bedfab62ca374979cae461b13aabc1f7","RawContent":"Hello Everyone, I am a newbie to this site and this is my first posting. My fianc\u00a9 and I are aiming for May 2014 for our wedding. Right now, we are in between HRPC and the Paradisus Palma Real for our wedding venue. This upcoming June, we are supposed to go and do a site inspection and make a final decision. I can&#039;t even tell you how glad I am to have found this site for all the information and support! I was wondering if anyone has decided what they are doing for hair and makeup?","Attachments":[],"Id":1742671,"PostDate":1365221914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello Everyone, I am a newbie to this site and this is my first posting. My fianc\u00a9 and I are aiming for May 2014 for our wedding. Right now, we are in between HRPC and the Paradisus Palma Real for our wedding venue. This upcoming June, we are supposed to go and do a site inspection and make a final decision. I can't even tell you how glad I am to have found this site for all the information and support! I was wondering if anyone has decided what they are doing for hair and makeup?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksaeuong@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355416552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263223.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ksaeuong","Id":263223,"Name":"ksaeuong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77e6a55ec5f4eefc6b6c3ada6d9a3222","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JaxBchKay\"]\nDRBride11- So glad you are going!!!  I have been putting off signing my contract because I am so nervous!  The past several reviews I have seen online read like horror stories on customer service.  I would be thrilled to get your opinion on how they do.  The last thing I want is to have my family and friends show up for my wedding and have them service be horrible.  They have also said that all the pools except the Eden pool are looking a little run down, would you mind taking pics of a few of them?  Thanks so much!!   [\/quote] TOTALLY in the same position. The reviews are nerve racking but the resort has everything that we want. But do I sacrifice the customer service for it? I have a wide variety of ages going thus I want this to be as stress free as it can be. I would love to know if you fully commit to the resort. Happy planning.","Attachments":[],"Id":1742747,"PostDate":1365265043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"JaxBchKay\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides\/60#post_1891959\"><p>DRBride11- So glad you are going!!!\u00a0 I have been putting off signing my contract because I am so nervous!\u00a0 The past several reviews I have seen online read like horror stories on customer service.\u00a0 I would be thrilled to get your opinion on how they do.\u00a0 The last thing I want is to have my family and friends show up for my wedding and have them service be horrible.\u00a0 They have also said that all the pools except the Eden pool are looking a little run down, would you mind taking pics of a few of them?\u00a0 Thanks so much!!\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> TOTALLY in the same position. The reviews are nerve racking but the resort has everything that we want. But do I sacrifice the customer service for it? I have a wide variety of ages going thus I want this to be as stress free as it can be. I would love to know if you fully commit to the resort. Happy planning.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmapue@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.73.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364441671,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267890.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tricia-m","Id":267890,"Name":"tricia-m","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
