{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a29500c90841f17f63683e89c32d1ca","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KerriAnn5\"]\nHi Kiki! I have seen both in person and the element terrace has a GREAT view of the beach. I went with the eclipse only because i have elderly and guest who can not climb steps and eclipse has a staircase. Did anyone send you photos of it?[\/quote] Are these the locations for private receptions after the ceremony? If so, are either of you ladies planning to have music or an open bar?","Attachments":[],"Id":1742749,"PostDate":1365265173,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"KerriAnn5\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides\/30#post_1878866\"><p>Hi Kiki! I have seen both in person and the element terrace has a GREAT view of the beach. I went with the eclipse only because i have elderly and guest who can not climb steps and eclipse has a staircase. Did anyone send you photos of it?<\/p><\/blockquote> Are these the locations for private receptions after the ceremony? If so, are either of you ladies planning to have music or an open bar?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmapue@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.73.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364441671,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267890.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tricia-m","Id":267890,"Name":"tricia-m","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2eb6df5a52a021896a414db28faf570","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Jochy Campusano is a well known make up artist from Santo Domingo. &amp;nbsp;Check his website and contact him to see if he&#039;d come to punta cana. &amp;nbsp;He can also provide photography team.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742798,"PostDate":1365272352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Jochy Campusano is a well known make up artist from Santo Domingo. \u00a0Check his website and contact him to see if he'd come to punta cana. \u00a0He can also provide photography team.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kellys8525@gmail.com","IpAddress":"186.7.250.139","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309623758,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241872.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DRBride11","Id":241872,"Name":"DRBride11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fc181ed29381077147feab253d1bd26","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My fiancee and I are going to do a site visit in July. We are scheduled to get married on January 18, 2013. We have about 50 guests right now and we look forward to our visit so we can try to decide where to have events. We plan on taking pics as well. If you search around the Hard Rock Punta Cana site under Destination Weddings in Punta Cana you will see&amp;nbsp;a lot of pictures of the resort. Katya Nova posted some great pictures. We wanted her to do our pictures but she will be out of the country. We are disappointed because her pictures are amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1745903,"PostDate":1366153138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My fiancee and I are going to do a site visit in July. We are scheduled to get married on January 18, 2013. We have about 50 guests right now and we look forward to our visit so we can try to decide where to have events. We plan on taking pics as well. If you search around the Hard Rock Punta Cana site under Destination Weddings in Punta Cana you will see\u00a0a lot of pictures of the resort. Katya Nova posted some great pictures. We wanted her to do our pictures but she will be out of the country. We are disappointed because her pictures are amazing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c670db75a2c3079447b964051e7ef259","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My fiancee and I are going to do a site visit in July. We are scheduled to get married on January 18, 2013. We have about 50 guests right now and we look forward to our visit so we can try to decide where to have events. We plan on taking pics as well. If you search around the Hard Rock Punta Cana site under Destination Weddings in Punta Cana you will see&amp;nbsp;a lot of pictures of the resort. Katya Nova posted some great pictures. We wanted her to do our pictures but she will be out of the country. We are disappointed because her pictures are amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1747403,"PostDate":1366153138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My fiancee and I are going to do a site visit in July. We are scheduled to get married on January 18, 2013. We have about 50 guests right now and we look forward to our visit so we can try to decide where to have events. We plan on taking pics as well. If you search around the Hard Rock Punta Cana site under Destination Weddings in Punta Cana you will see\u00a0a lot of pictures of the resort. Katya Nova posted some great pictures. We wanted her to do our pictures but she will be out of the country. We are disappointed because her pictures are amazing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97cff2adcb13237c1df778922493396d","RawContent":"Hey ladies! I am in the process of planning my wedding right now and not 100% on all of the venues yet. Doing a site inspection in June to lock everything down! So far, my plan is to stay at the hard rock but have my wedding at the Jellyfish. Wondering if anyone knows if and how much HRH would charge me to have my photog and make-up artist on site for just a couple of hours while I get dressed?","Attachments":[],"Id":1749140,"PostDate":1366573107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies! I am in the process of planning my wedding right now and not 100% on all of the venues yet. Doing a site inspection in June to lock everything down! So far, my plan is to stay at the hard rock but have my wedding at the Jellyfish. Wondering if anyone knows if and how much HRH would charge me to have my photog and make-up artist on site for just a couple of hours while I get dressed?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksaeuong@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355416552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263223.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ksaeuong","Id":263223,"Name":"ksaeuong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cc615dac466c2ec3f1fb9ace2b5829b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I need help from anyone that has visited the HRPC, I&#039;m getting married January 15, 2014 and working with Mia a Miami wedding coordinator. Well she says that all of the cocktail\/reception and wedding sites are booked up and we don&#039;t have an alternate site in the case of rain. She says the only thing that is available is the Woodstock pool, which we are booked for, and which I can&#039;t find a picture of anywhere. I&#039;m having to base my decision on her advise, which is nerve racking, because I don&#039;t know if it is a honest opinion. So, if anyone has seen the Woodstock pool could you please tell me something about Mia says that it is very nice, I can&#039;t tell from the very limited pictures and view, which it looks like a big slab of concrete, and one review said that it was one of the loudest pools. I&#039;m at the end of my rope with this, if we don&#039;t get more information and\/or the HRPC can&#039;t accommodate us with an alternative rain site we might change our plans in mid-stream and go with another hotel, although I REALLY wanted the HRPC. Please help, any information would be GREAT, thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1752188,"PostDate":1367270899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I need help from anyone that has visited the HRPC, I'm getting married January 15, 2014 and working with Mia a Miami wedding coordinator. Well she says that all of the cocktail\/reception and wedding sites are booked up and we don't have an alternate site in the case of rain. She says the only thing that is available is the Woodstock pool, which we are booked for, and which I can't find a picture of anywhere. I'm having to base my decision on her advise, which is nerve racking, because I don't know if it is a honest opinion. So, if anyone has seen the Woodstock pool could you please tell me something about Mia says that it is very nice, I can't tell from the very limited pictures and view, which it looks like a big slab of concrete, and one review said that it was one of the loudest pools. I'm at the end of my rope with this, if we don't get more information and\/or the HRPC can't accommodate us with an alternative rain site we might change our plans in mid-stream and go with another hotel, although I REALLY wanted the HRPC. Please help, any information would be GREAT, thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelaricher@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357943503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264279.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngieRich","Id":264279,"Name":"AngieRich","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53cf8a1b0baae8a0810ffb3f64997a54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello AngieRich! You are getting married three days before my fiancee Kelly and I. Wednesday must be a really busy day for weddings. I don&#039;t have any advise at this time although we are scheduled to go to the hard HRPC in mid-July. Barry&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1752729,"PostDate":1367364890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello AngieRich! You are getting married three days before my fiancee Kelly and I. Wednesday must be a really busy day for weddings. I don't have any advise at this time although we are scheduled to go to the hard HRPC in mid-July. Barry<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a881fad61877c31e1a30068929d4240","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AngieRich[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Ladies, \n \n I need help from anyone that has visited the HRPC, I&#039;m getting married January 15, 2014 and working with Mia a Miami wedding coordinator. Well she says that all of the cocktail\/reception and wedding sites are booked up and we don&#039;t have an alternate site in the case of rain. She says the only thing that is available is the Woodstock pool, which we are booked for, and which I can&#039;t find a picture of anywhere. I&#039;m having to base my decision on her advise, which is nerve racking, because I don&#039;t know if it is a honest opinion. So, if anyone has seen the Woodstock pool could you please tell me something about Mia says that it is very nice, I can&#039;t tell from the very limited pictures and view, which it looks like a big slab of concrete, and one review said that it was one of the loudest pools. I&#039;m at the end of my rope with this, if we don&#039;t get more information and\/or the HRPC can&#039;t accommodate us with an alternative rain site we might change our plans in mid-stream and go with another hotel, although I REALLY wanted the HRPC. Please help, any information would be GREAT, thanks![\/quote] \n \n Hello AngieRich! You are getting married three days before my fiancee Kelly and I. Wednesday must be a really busy day for weddings. I don&#039;t have any advise at this time although we are scheduled to go to the hard HRPC in mid-July. Barry","Attachments":[],"Id":1752733,"PostDate":1367365965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AngieRich<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I need help from anyone that has visited the HRPC, I'm getting married January 15, 2014 and working with Mia a Miami wedding coordinator. Well she says that all of the cocktail\/reception and wedding sites are booked up and we don't have an alternate site in the case of rain. She says the only thing that is available is the Woodstock pool, which we are booked for, and which I can't find a picture of anywhere. I'm having to base my decision on her advise, which is nerve racking, because I don't know if it is a honest opinion. So, if anyone has seen the Woodstock pool could you please tell me something about Mia says that it is very nice, I can't tell from the very limited pictures and view, which it looks like a big slab of concrete, and one review said that it was one of the loudest pools. I'm at the end of my rope with this, if we don't get more information and\/or the HRPC can't accommodate us with an alternative rain site we might change our plans in mid-stream and go with another hotel, although I REALLY wanted the HRPC. Please help, any information would be GREAT, thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hello AngieRich! You are getting married three days before my fiancee Kelly and I. Wednesday must be a really busy day for weddings. I don't have any advise at this time although we are scheduled to go to the hard HRPC in mid-July. Barry<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f77b43bc13d9acada1d514a91c10e8bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m a newbie - first post.&amp;nbsp; I just booked my wedding at the HRPC for&amp;nbsp;3\/14\/14.&amp;nbsp; AngieRich, this is my biggest concern.  We want&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;ceremony&amp;nbsp;on the beach and the reception on a terrace close to the beach.  How long after submitting your location&amp;nbsp;preference&amp;nbsp;form did it take for Mia to tell&amp;nbsp;you that your choices are booked?&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t want months to go by before they tell me I may be stuck at a random pool.  My coordinator tells me not to worry because the resort is so big, so I&amp;nbsp;shouldn&#039;t have a problem&amp;nbsp;getting one of the beach locations&amp;nbsp;(Isla or Ipanema) and one of the terraces (Element or Toro).&amp;nbsp; But I can&#039;t grasp why they won&#039;t actually confirm until 30 days prior.&amp;nbsp; How is it that I&#039;ve seen examples of Save the Dates (on the All Classy FB page) where people are listing the exact beach\/reception sites? They must be sending those out several months ahead of time - are they just hoping for their requests to be met or are they getting actual confirmations?&amp;nbsp; AngieRich, something must be going on 1\/15\/14.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s a Wednesday - how can every location be unavailable?&amp;nbsp; You might want to push for answers.&amp;nbsp; I know that the whole resort was basically sold out for a period this past January for a concert and all of their die-hard fans.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1752970,"PostDate":1367419165,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm a newbie - first post.\u00a0 I just booked my wedding at the HRPC for\u00a03\/14\/14.\u00a0 AngieRich, this is my biggest concern.\u00a0\u00a0We want\u00a0a\u00a0ceremony\u00a0on the beach and the reception on a terrace close to the beach.\u00a0\u00a0How long after submitting your location\u00a0preference\u00a0form did it take for Mia to tell\u00a0you that your choices are booked?\u00a0 I don't want months to go by before they tell me I may be stuck at a random pool.\u00a0\u00a0My coordinator tells me not to worry because the resort is so big, so I\u00a0shouldn't have a problem\u00a0getting one of the beach locations\u00a0(Isla or Ipanema) and one of the terraces (Element or Toro).\u00a0 But I can't grasp why they won't actually confirm until 30 days prior.\u00a0 How is it that I've seen examples of Save the Dates (on the All Classy FB page) where people are listing the exact beach\/reception sites? They must be sending those out several months ahead of time - are they just hoping for their requests to be met or are they getting actual confirmations?\u00a0 AngieRich, something must be going on 1\/15\/14.\u00a0 It's a Wednesday - how can every location be unavailable?\u00a0 You might want to push for answers.\u00a0 I know that the whole resort was basically sold out for a period this past January for a concert and all of their die-hard fans.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ewallace@foleyhoag.com","IpAddress":"63.116.148.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365092438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268174.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ErinWally","Id":268174,"Name":"ErinWally","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0fe4ec65b513748d79c2ffb053e0372","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks, Barry, &amp;nbsp;wow you&#039;ll be getting married when we will be heading out, but we will be at the resort at the same time! My TA spoke with his contacts, although, right now we don&#039;t have a back-up site his contacts said that the Woodstock area was very nice. Any information on your impression and pictures of the different sites would be great and helpful to all of the HRPC 2014 brides. Also, they both agreed that January is a pretty dry month for weather.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congratulations!!!! I know both our weddings will be wonderful.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks again, Angie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1753366,"PostDate":1367458147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks, Barry, \u00a0wow you'll be getting married when we will be heading out, but we will be at the resort at the same time! My TA spoke with his contacts, although, right now we don't have a back-up site his contacts said that the Woodstock area was very nice. Any information on your impression and pictures of the different sites would be great and helpful to all of the HRPC 2014 brides. Also, they both agreed that January is a pretty dry month for weather.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congratulations!!!! I know both our weddings will be wonderful.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again, Angie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelaricher@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357943503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264279.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngieRich","Id":264279,"Name":"AngieRich","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
