> Time: 1434211450 / Sat, 13 Jun 2015 16:04:10 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=69910&start=80&SessionId=c7212f55310fdf4884bb297f494a5505
> User Beachwedding2016 (283521)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a9d6d2d9674d67d92e667ddbde7b99e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AngieRich[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks, Barry,  wow you&#039;ll be getting married when we will be heading out, but we will be at the resort at the same time! My TA spoke with his contacts, although, right now we don&#039;t have a back-up site his contacts said that the Woodstock area was very nice. Any information on your impression and pictures of the different sites would be great and helpful to all of the HRPC 2014 brides. Also, they both agreed that January is a pretty dry month for weather.  \n \n Congratulations!!!! I know both our weddings will be wonderful. \n \n Thanks again, Angie[\/quote] \n Angie, we handed in our request form for sites earlier this week. I will keep you posted once I hear back from them. Right now we have about 52 guests coming so we are hoping to get what we requested. We will probably just be arriving at HRPC when you are getting ready for your wedding!!! I am sure we will see you at some point! \n \n Kelly and Barry","Attachments":[],"Id":1755625,"PostDate":1368028924,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AngieRich<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks, Barry, \u00a0wow you'll be getting married when we will be heading out, but we will be at the resort at the same time! My TA spoke with his contacts, although, right now we don't have a back-up site his contacts said that the Woodstock area was very nice. Any information on your impression and pictures of the different sites would be great and helpful to all of the HRPC 2014 brides. Also, they both agreed that January is a pretty dry month for weather.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congratulations!!!! I know both our weddings will be wonderful.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again, Angie<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Angie, we handed in our request form for sites earlier this week. I will keep you posted once I hear back from them. Right now we have about 52 guests coming so we are hoping to get what we requested. We will probably just be arriving at HRPC when you are getting ready for your wedding!!! I am sure we will see you at some point!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kelly and Barry<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d38b571f7d389508dc789a29978aae2a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ksaeuong[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hello Everyone,\n \n I am a newbie to this site and this is my first posting. My fianc\u00a9 and I are aiming for May 2014 for our wedding. Right now, we are in between HRPC and the Paradisus Palma Real for our wedding venue. This upcoming June, we are supposed to go and do a site inspection and make a final decision. I can&#039;t even tell you how glad I am to have found this site for all the information and support!\n \n I was wondering if anyone has decided what they are doing for hair and makeup?[\/quote] \n [color=#006699]Congratulations @ksaeuong and welcome to the forum! Both resorts are great choices, that definitely is going to be a tough decision to pick just one! [\/color] \n \n [color=#006699]For your [b]site inspection[\/b], the [b]Paradisus[\/b] does offer a discounted site inspection package, (which would basically be free if you book your wedding with them), with 3 nights stay - [url=\"http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\/romance-inspectionfirstvisit-loveatfirstsite.php\"]http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\/romance-inspectionfirstvisit-loveatfirstsite.php[\/url] - You basically will pay for the inspection up front, and if and when you do book your wedding package with Paradisus, you will get a credit back.[\/color] \n \n [color=#808080][i]\"A credit will be applied towards the bride\/groom&#039;s final payment on the wedding package selected. This credit will be equal to the cost of the site inspection package and limited to the value of the first 3-nights of their stay.\"[\/i][\/color] \n \n [color=#006699]I hope this helps, let me know if you want me to send you any information on this further.[\/color] \n \n [color=#006699]Happy planning![\/color] \n \n [color=#006699]-Jill[\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1756355,"PostDate":1368142172,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ksaeuong<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hello Everyone,<br \/> <br \/> I am a newbie to this site and this is my first posting. My fianc\u00a9 and I are aiming for May 2014 for our wedding. Right now, we are in between HRPC and the Paradisus Palma Real for our wedding venue. This upcoming June, we are supposed to go and do a site inspection and make a final decision. I can't even tell you how glad I am to have found this site for all the information and support!<br \/> <br \/> I was wondering if anyone has decided what they are doing for hair and makeup?<\/blockquote> <p> <span  style=\"color:#006699\">Congratulations @ksaeuong and welcome to the forum! Both resorts are great choices, that definitely is going to be a tough decision to pick just one! <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#006699\">For your <strong>site inspection<\/strong>, the <strong>Paradisus<\/strong> does offer a discounted site inspection package, (which would basically be free if you book your wedding with them), with 3 nights stay - <a href='http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\/romance-inspectionfirstvisit-loveatfirstsite.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.paradisus...atfirstsite.php<\/a> - You basically will pay for the inspection up front, and if and when you do book your wedding package with Paradisus, you will get a credit back.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#808080\"><em>\"A credit will be applied towards the bride\/groom's final payment on the wedding package selected. This credit will be equal to the cost of the site inspection package and limited to the value of the first 3-nights of their stay.\"<\/em><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#006699\">I hope this helps, let me know if you want me to send you any information on this further.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#006699\">Happy planning!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#006699\">-Jill<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jill@bluepetalweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1360017522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265653.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":182,"PhotoHeight":118,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JillTran","Id":265653,"Name":"JillTran","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d50cee3e7f8343b63ebfbf3681c9cfbe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies, I will be getting married may of next year. &amp;nbsp;Was wondering how you are able to do a site inspection, is your stay free or put towards wedding costs?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1756896,"PostDate":1368287133,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies, I will be getting married may of next year. \u00a0Was wondering how you are able to do a site inspection, is your stay free or put towards wedding costs?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevie@knights.ucf.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368202143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269473.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s2bebride","Id":269473,"Name":"s2bebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9322586718f15cc458abf32b7162fa1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"s2bebride\"]\nHi ladies, I will be getting married may of next year.  Was wondering how you are able to do a site inspection, is your stay free or put towards wedding costs?[\/quote] I asked the same thing when I booked my site inspection but thy said no. I am looking at another resort, Paradisus Palma Real, and they do credit your site inspection towards your wedding if you book there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1758339,"PostDate":1368711884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"s2bebride\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides\/60#post_1904965\"><p>Hi ladies, I will be getting married may of next year. \u00a0Was wondering how you are able to do a site inspection, is your stay free or put towards wedding costs?<\/p><\/blockquote> I asked the same thing when I booked my site inspection but thy said no. I am looking at another resort, Paradisus Palma Real, and they do credit your site inspection towards your wedding if you book there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksaeuong@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355416552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263223.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ksaeuong","Id":263223,"Name":"ksaeuong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"adcabab18a22ce44b29b60c7797e93ad","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]s2bebride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi ladies, I will be getting married may of next year.  Was wondering how you are able to do a site inspection, is your stay free or put towards wedding costs?[\/quote] \n \n I called about this, they quoted me $238.00 per night for a site inspection. I&#039;m not sure if the monies are put towards the actual wedding date, but I&#039;m going to ask about that as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":1759174,"PostDate":1368923699,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>s2bebride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi ladies, I will be getting married may of next year. \u00a0Was wondering how you are able to do a site inspection, is your stay free or put towards wedding costs?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> I called about this, they quoted me $238.00 per night for a site inspection. I'm not sure if the monies are put towards the actual wedding date, but I'm going to ask about that as well.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sheresanichol@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.6.5.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366938275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sheresa509","Id":268988,"Name":"sheresa509","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cc162c010bdcff1eb10b7ec8ca24895","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sheresa509[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n I called about this, they quoted me $238.00 per night for a site inspection. I&#039;m not sure if the monies are put towards the actual wedding date, but I&#039;m going to ask about that as well.[\/quote] \n If you book your wedding there, the monies that were spent (up to 3 nights) will be put towards your wedding. Hope this helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1759318,"PostDate":1368990706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sheresa509<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> I called about this, they quoted me $238.00 per night for a site inspection. I'm not sure if the monies are put towards the actual wedding date, but I'm going to ask about that as well.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> If you book your wedding there, the monies that were spent (up to 3 nights) will be put towards your wedding. Hope this helps!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksaeuong@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355416552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263223.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ksaeuong","Id":263223,"Name":"ksaeuong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0b5eefd93fe4b8f891e3c235684b771","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ksaeuong[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Quote: \n Originally Posted by [b]sheresa509[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n I called about this, they quoted me $238.00 per night for a site inspection. I&#039;m not sure if the monies are put towards the actual wedding date, but I&#039;m going to ask about that as well.[\/quote] \n If you book your wedding there, the monies that were spent (up to 3 nights) will be put towards your wedding. Hope this helps!   \n \n Thank you, and thank GOD!!! This stuff adds up quick! There are so many things I want to add to my wedding, but someone else mentioned that its cheaper to add upgrades directly with the HR and not the Miami office. I hear they charge double, does anyone know if that&#039;s true?","Attachments":[],"Id":1759324,"PostDate":1368992922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ksaeuong<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <span>Quote:<\/span> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>sheresa509<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> I called about this, they quoted me $238.00 per night for a site inspection. I'm not sure if the monies are put towards the actual wedding date, but I'm going to ask about that as well.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> If you book your wedding there, the monies that were spent (up to 3 nights) will be put towards your wedding. Hope this helps!<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p> <br \/> Thank you, and thank GOD!!! This stuff adds up quick! There are so many things I want to add to my wedding, but someone else mentioned that its cheaper to add upgrades directly with the HR and not the Miami office. I hear they charge double, does anyone know if that's true?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sheresanichol@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.6.5.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366938275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sheresa509","Id":268988,"Name":"sheresa509","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"260fc5ec2c46ea2f0cff98d8c28f37f1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"sheresa509\"]\nThank you, and thank GOD!!! This stuff adds up quick! There are so many things I want to add to my wedding, but someone else mentioned that its cheaper to add upgrades directly with the HR and not the Miami office. I hear they charge double, does anyone know if that&#039;s true?[\/quote] Omg!!!! I&#039;m so so sorry! I thought I was on the Paradisus Palma Real forum. The Hard Rock does NOT put the site inspection cost towards the wedding. (I asked the Miami office) I am doing a site inspection in June at HRH and PPR. Only the Paradisus does that... :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1759336,"PostDate":1368998962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"sheresa509\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides\/60#post_1907393\"><p>Thank you, and thank GOD!!! This stuff adds up quick! There are so many things I want to add to my wedding, but someone else mentioned that its cheaper to add upgrades directly with the HR and not the Miami office. I hear they charge double, does anyone know if that's true?<\/p><\/blockquote> Omg!!!! I'm so so sorry! I thought I was on the Paradisus Palma Real forum. The Hard Rock does NOT put the site inspection cost towards the wedding. (I asked the Miami office) I am doing a site inspection in June at HRH and PPR. Only the Paradisus does that... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksaeuong@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355416552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263223.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ksaeuong","Id":263223,"Name":"ksaeuong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb2b31d0974937084b7f01d20df43831","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ksaeuong\"]\n[quote name=\"sheresa509\"]\n Thank you, and thank GOD!!! This stuff adds up quick! There are so many things I want to add to my wedding, but someone else mentioned that its cheaper to add upgrades directly with the HR and not the Miami office. I hear they charge double, does anyone know if that&#039;s true?[\/quote] Omg!!!! I&#039;m so so sorry! I thought I was on the Paradisus Palma Real forum. The Hard Rock does NOT put the site inspection cost towards the wedding. (I asked the Miami office) I am doing a site inspection in June at HRH and PPR. Only the Paradisus does that... :([\/quote] It&#039;s okay. Lol! I kind of figured that lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1759938,"PostDate":1369196432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"ksaeuong\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides\/60#post_1907405\"><p><blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"sheresa509\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides\/60#post_1907393\"><p> Thank you, and thank GOD!!! This stuff adds up quick! There are so many things I want to add to my wedding, but someone else mentioned that its cheaper to add upgrades directly with the HR and not the Miami office. I hear they charge double, does anyone know if that's true?<\/p><\/blockquote> Omg!!!! I'm so so sorry! I thought I was on the Paradisus Palma Real forum. The Hard Rock does NOT put the site inspection cost towards the wedding. (I asked the Miami office) I am doing a site inspection in June at HRH and PPR. Only the Paradisus does that... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p><\/blockquote> It's okay. Lol! I kind of figured that lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sheresanichol@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.6.5.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366938275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sheresa509","Id":268988,"Name":"sheresa509","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13611bba1fa12c727b4b898df4fceab6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m currently booked at HRPC for Feb 2014, but we are finding rates way too high for our guests. We&#039;re flying out of Toronto... Love the resort but pretty sure I&#039;m going to have to switch. Unless I just move to a different month, April or May perhaps? How is everyone finding the rates for next year?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1771815,"PostDate":1372093939,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm currently booked at HRPC for Feb 2014, but we are finding rates way too high for our guests. We're flying out of Toronto... Love the resort but pretty sure I'm going to have to switch. Unless I just move to a different month, April or May perhaps? How is everyone finding the rates for next year?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.camille@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.77.181.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350343914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261397.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alycamille","Id":261397,"Name":"alycamille","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
