{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94059d18d1b079452e6a4f992661bd8b","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;alycamille&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m currently booked at HRPC for Feb 2014, but we are finding rates way too high for our guests. We&#039;re flying out of Toronto... Love the resort but pretty sure I&#039;m going to have to switch. Unless I just move to a different month, April or May perhaps? How is everyone finding the rates for next year?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; I think the rates are high..My wedding isat the hard rock april 5 2014 each guest is going to have 1900$","Attachments":[],"Id":1771925,"PostDate":1372104243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>alycamille<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p> Hi ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm currently booked at HRPC for Feb 2014, but we are finding rates way too high for our guests. We're flying out of Toronto... Love the resort but pretty sure I'm going to have to switch. Unless I just move to a different month, April or May perhaps? How is everyone finding the rates for next year?<\/p> <\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> I think the rates are high..My wedding isat the hard rock april 5 2014 each guest is going to have 1900$\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lynnann32@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370807735,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270401.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lynnann","Id":270401,"Name":"lynnann","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"003fba7a07ca5319cc66d0c9b5dee8a2","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]alycamille[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi ladies, \n \n I&#039;m currently booked at HRPC for Feb 2014, but we are finding rates way too high for our guests. We&#039;re flying out of Toronto... Love the resort but pretty sure I&#039;m going to have to switch. Unless I just move to a different month, April or May perhaps? How is everyone finding the rates for next year?[\/quote] \n I am currently waiting for my TA to get me rates for the HRPC. If they are too high then we will stick with Paradisus Punta Cana","Attachments":[],"Id":1772028,"PostDate":1372121761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>alycamille<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm currently booked at HRPC for Feb 2014, but we are finding rates way too high for our guests. We're flying out of Toronto... Love the resort but pretty sure I'm going to have to switch. Unless I just move to a different month, April or May perhaps? How is everyone finding the rates for next year?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I am currently waiting for my TA to get me rates for the HRPC. If they are too high then we will stick with Paradisus Punta Cana<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"craddocksl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.10.25.244","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369209172,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269841.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shara1984","Id":269841,"Name":"Shara1984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74352a9c137820d573db5c155ea80da5","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Shara1984[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I am currently waiting for my TA to get me rates for the HRPC. If they are too high then we will stick with Paradisus Punta Cana[\/quote] \n We are getting married in January 2014 and if you like I can inbox you our rates. There will be a difference because we are out of Philadelphia.","Attachments":[],"Id":1773014,"PostDate":1372346460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Shara1984<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I am currently waiting for my TA to get me rates for the HRPC. If they are too high then we will stick with Paradisus Punta Cana<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> We are getting married in January 2014 and if you like I can inbox you our rates. There will be a difference because we are out of Philadelphia.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9dad29e710092183ff05174129c92de7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Just booked at the HRPC for May 9th 2014!!! So excited! and already super overwhlemed lol&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1372786782400_1177\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1774633,"PostDate":1372786723,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just booked at the HRPC for May 9th 2014!!! So excited! and already super overwhlemed lol\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1372786782400_1177\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexi.torres@ymail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372786485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271124.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AlexiRae","Id":271124,"Name":"AlexiRae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d28805476763b0df59272db43aa2ccd2","RawContent":"We are getting married at HRPC on April 11\/2014. Yay! Rates are pricey but we really wanted this resort so pushed our TA and we got prices we could live with. Our choice was between HRPC and Dreams (apparently both resorts have all food tendered by USA Costco). Based on a friend&#039;s experience getting married at HRPC in 2012, the resort credit and the overall resort amenities we decided on HRPC. We are dealing Mia in Miami as well and she seems really helpful so far. Struggling with which photographer to use? Any advice? Congrats to everyone on your engagements and upcoming weddings :) Happy planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1775210,"PostDate":1372896775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married at HRPC on April 11\/2014. Yay! Rates are pricey but we really wanted this resort so pushed our TA and we got prices we could live with. Our choice was between HRPC and Dreams (apparently both resorts have all food tendered by USA Costco). Based on a friend's experience getting married at HRPC in 2012, the resort credit and the overall resort amenities we decided on HRPC. We are dealing Mia in Miami as well and she seems really helpful so far. Struggling with which photographer to use? Any advice? Congrats to everyone on your engagements and upcoming weddings <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Happy planning\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ahackett75@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"156.34.10.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370214506,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270200.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngBN","Id":270200,"Name":"AngBN","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9d5bc8824d55385be343e813e98bbef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I was hoping to do a rehearsal dinner at one of the restaurants, but I have heard that you cannot have over a table of 10 people at the restaurants and will have to do a private event. &amp;nbsp;Does anyone know what that ranges if you cannot get enough room nights for a paid private event?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1775660,"PostDate":1373070159,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I was hoping to do a rehearsal dinner at one of the restaurants, but I have heard that you cannot have over a table of 10 people at the restaurants and will have to do a private event. \u00a0Does anyone know what that ranges if you cannot get enough room nights for a paid private event?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevie@knights.ucf.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368202143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269473.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s2bebride","Id":269473,"Name":"s2bebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"accb5099f7e59bbade8fe774368b11e5","RawContent":"Hi ladies! It&#039;s been so long since I have Been able to get on here. S2bebride I think it&#039;s 50$ a person for a private function I will check my documents today because I am having a welcome dinner the night before my wedding as well. I&#039;m having my welcome dinner at the Eden pool and I&#039;m also having a cocktail hour and a 4 hour reception in one of the ballrooms. I&#039;m basically done with the planning process and my wedding is march 8th 2014. If any one has questions let me Know I have tons of info from the resort and from the decorations company. I worked directly with them because Miami was charging me double for the decor I picked out. I also did not chose the photographer on site I wasn&#039;t crazy about their work. I booked HDC because of their great reviews on here","Attachments":[],"Id":1776511,"PostDate":1373372366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies! It's been so long since I have Been able to get on here. S2bebride I think it's 50$ a person for a private function I will check my documents today because I am having a welcome dinner the night before my wedding as well. I'm having my welcome dinner at the Eden pool and I'm also having a cocktail hour and a 4 hour reception in one of the ballrooms. I'm basically done with the planning process and my wedding is march 8th 2014. If any one has questions let me Know I have tons of info from the resort and from the decorations company. I worked directly with them because Miami was charging me double for the decor I picked out. I also did not chose the photographer on site I wasn't crazy about their work. I booked HDC because of their great reviews on here\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b37442bb0f8ab710a49a1900b5907c1c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KerriAnn5[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi ladies! It&#039;s been so long since I have Been able to get on here. S2bebride I think it&#039;s 50$ a person for a private function I will check my documents today because I am having a welcome dinner the night before my wedding as well. I&#039;m having my welcome dinner at the Eden pool and I&#039;m also having a cocktail hour and a 4 hour reception in one of the ballrooms. I&#039;m basically done with the planning process and my wedding is march 8th 2014. If any one has questions let me\n Know I have tons of info from the resort and from the decorations company. I worked directly with them because Miami was charging me double for the decor I picked out. I also did not chose the photographer on site I wasn&#039;t crazy about their work. I booked HDC because of their great reviews on here[\/quote] \n Hello KerriAnn5! It&#039;s Barry again. Thanks for the guidance on the site visit you gave me in February......we booked our site visit soon after. We are going next week to take a much needed vacation and to solidify the final plans for our January 2014 wedding. We are both very visual so we have to go or we won&#039;t feel comfortable about picking a place for the wedding and reception. I have to admit the we were a little hesitant about booking with HRPC in December but since we have worked with Jennifer, who recently left, we have not had any problems or issues. I My fianc\u00a9e works the Facebook wedding pages for DR brides and I do the Punta Cana blogs on this site and all we hear is....get there and get your hooks into your wedding planner. I plan to do just that!!! \n \n We are also having a welcome event at the Eden Pool on Friday evening. We have been confirmed to have our reception at the Element Terrace but we are not sure if we want to have it outside But we will decide by the time that we leave next week. The good thing about it is that we far exceed the room nights count for the two free three hours events so that helps in the pockets.  We have already decided to not use the on-site photographer and videographer.....we didn&#039;t hear great things either. Well thanks again......I check in from time to time since I am pretty active in the planning of our wedding. \n \n Barry","Attachments":[],"Id":1776597,"PostDate":1373388488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KerriAnn5<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi ladies! It's been so long since I have Been able to get on here. S2bebride I think it's 50$ a person for a private function I will check my documents today because I am having a welcome dinner the night before my wedding as well. I'm having my welcome dinner at the Eden pool and I'm also having a cocktail hour and a 4 hour reception in one of the ballrooms. I'm basically done with the planning process and my wedding is march 8th 2014. If any one has questions let me<br \/> Know I have tons of info from the resort and from the decorations company. I worked directly with them because Miami was charging me double for the decor I picked out. I also did not chose the photographer on site I wasn't crazy about their work. I booked HDC because of their great reviews on here<\/blockquote> <p> Hello KerriAnn5! It's Barry again. Thanks for the guidance on the site visit you gave me in February......we booked our site visit soon after. We are\u00a0going next week to take a much needed vacation and to solidify the final plans for our January 2014 wedding. We are both very visual so we have to go or we won't feel comfortable about picking a place for the wedding and reception. I have to admit the we were a little hesitant about booking with HRPC in December but since we have worked with Jennifer, who recently left, we have not had any problems or issues. I My fianc\u00a9e works the Facebook wedding pages for DR brides\u00a0and I do the Punta Cana blogs on this site and all we hear is....get there and get your hooks into your wedding planner. I plan to do just that!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are also having a welcome event at the Eden Pool on Friday evening. We have been confirmed to have our reception at the Element Terrace but we are not sure if we want to have it outside But we will decide by the time that we leave next week.\u00a0The good thing about it is that we far exceed the room nights count for the two free three hours events so that helps in the pockets.\u00a0 We have already decided to not use the on-site photographer and videographer.....we didn't hear great things either. Well thanks again......I check in from time to time since I am pretty active in the planning of our wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Barry<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3eb09eb023090fc3bf233d573b793587","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; How are you ladies able to confirm locations for private functions already, my planner is renee, and she is extremely short and vague always! If you pay for a function, do you get a list of site to choose from vs. when you have enough room nights that it is covered for you? Keriann, how were you able to get an off site decor company? i feel that I know so little about the entire process and my coordinator is not very hands on or good at communicating&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1776721,"PostDate":1373405473,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> How are you ladies able to confirm locations for private functions already, my planner is renee, and she is extremely short and vague always! If you pay for a function, do you get a list of site to choose from vs. when you have enough room nights that it is covered for you? Keriann, how were you able to get an off site decor company? i feel that I know so little about the entire process and my coordinator is not very hands on or good at communicating<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevie@knights.ucf.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368202143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269473.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s2bebride","Id":269473,"Name":"s2bebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2497d0e48396a9724e6d397cb1178864","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Also when is everyone sending out invitations, I saw somewhere that you have to have numbers confirmed and everything paid 60 days out, so does that mean replies need to be in 2 months before hand as well, it just seems so early to send invites out 4 months ahead of time?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1776722,"PostDate":1373405583,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Also when is everyone sending out invitations, I saw somewhere that you have to have numbers confirmed and everything paid 60 days out, so does that mean replies need to be in 2 months before hand as well, it just seems so early to send invites out 4 months ahead of time?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevie@knights.ucf.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368202143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269473.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s2bebride","Id":269473,"Name":"s2bebride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
