> User Beachwedding2016 (283521)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be9734a3a013ed9fd5e86e0ccde77042","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]s2bebride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n How are you ladies able to confirm locations for private functions already, my planner is renee, and she is extremely short and vague always! If you pay for a function, do you get a list of site to choose from vs. when you have enough room nights that it is covered for you? Keriann, how were you able to get an off site decor company? i feel that I know so little about the entire process and my coordinator is not very hands on or good at communicating[\/quote] \n I e mailed my Lisa my WC and told her where i wanted each party to be. I did a site visit so i was able to see where i wanted everything.The same sites you have to chose from for paid functions are the same sites you chose from for the free private functions. They wont confirm that you have the free functions until the rooms are booked. If you e mail Renee and ask her for the sites she will send then. I suggest you chose locations quickly because the resort is becoming really popular and everything is booking quickly. I googled the name of the decor company catalog they gave me and just e mailed them directly and got a quote. [size=3][color=#009933][url=\"http:\/\/www.weddingsandeventsinpuntacana.com\"]www.weddingsandeventsinpuntacana.com[\/url][\/color][\/size] that is their website and they have a great facebook page as well!","Attachments":[],"Id":1776765,"PostDate":1373412781,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>s2bebride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> How are you ladies able to confirm locations for private functions already, my planner is renee, and she is extremely short and vague always! If you pay for a function, do you get a list of site to choose from vs. when you have enough room nights that it is covered for you? Keriann, how were you able to get an off site decor company? i feel that I know so little about the entire process and my coordinator is not very hands on or good at communicating<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I e mailed my Lisa my WC and told her where i wanted each party to be. I did a site visit so i was able to see where i wanted everything.The same sites you have to chose from for paid functions are the same sites you chose from for the free private functions. They wont confirm that you have the free functions until the rooms are booked. If you e mail Renee and ask her for the sites she will send then. I suggest you chose locations quickly because the resort is becoming really popular and everything is booking quickly. I googled the name of the decor company catalog they gave me and just e mailed them directly and got a quote. <font color=\"#009933\" size=\"3\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsandeventsinpuntacana.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.weddingsandeventsinpuntacana.com<\/a><\/font>\u00a0that is their website and they have a great facebook page as well!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62bfaf4337dd6c9ebd61c9d1decfa804","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]s2bebride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Also when is everyone sending out invitations, I saw somewhere that you have to have numbers confirmed and everything paid 60 days out, so does that mean replies need to be in 2 months before hand as well, it just seems so early to send invites out 4 months ahead of time?[\/quote] \n I sent my save the dates our a year in advance. MOST of my guest are already booked but i am mailing the formal invites out the third week in august after i get them back from my calligrapher. If anyone is in the NY area my calligrapher is AMAZING and really reasonable, I put the RSVP date for Noveber 8th. I figure if people arent booked three months before the wedding then are they really going to book at all? My Wedding is March 8th","Attachments":[],"Id":1776767,"PostDate":1373412920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>s2bebride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Also when is everyone sending out invitations, I saw somewhere that you have to have numbers confirmed and everything paid 60 days out, so does that mean replies need to be in 2 months before hand as well, it just seems so early to send invites out 4 months ahead of time?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I sent my save the dates our a year in advance. MOST of my guest are already booked but i am mailing the formal invites out the third week in august after i get them back from my calligrapher. If anyone is in the NY area my calligrapher is AMAZING and really reasonable, I put the RSVP date for Noveber 8th. I figure if people arent booked three months before the wedding then are they really going to book at all? My Wedding is March 8th<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b92e8577a26ab9992759244276bbfeac","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]s2bebride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n How are you ladies able to confirm locations for private functions already, my planner is renee, and she is extremely short and vague always! If you pay for a function, do you get a list of site to choose from vs. when you have enough room nights that it is covered for you? Keriann, how were you able to get an off site decor company? i feel that I know so little about the entire process and my coordinator is not very hands on or good at communicating[\/quote] \n I&#039;m piggy backing on KerriAnn5&#039;s response. We did a request form some months ago but never heard back from anyone. So when we asked about it we were told that you would only hear back if your request was denied. But I have been telling my fianc\u00a9e that I really think that it comes down to money. Meaning that if I have the Element Terrace approved with my 55 guests and someone comes along with 100 guests......I am going to get bumped. Now that is just my opinion but money talks. When we visit next week I hope to have a firmer commitment on my locations after we meet with our WC. \n \n P.S. I&#039;m a guy....just call me an \"active groom\"! lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1776945,"PostDate":1373465496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>s2bebride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> How are you ladies able to confirm locations for private functions already, my planner is renee, and she is extremely short and vague always! If you pay for a function, do you get a list of site to choose from vs. when you have enough room nights that it is covered for you? Keriann, how were you able to get an off site decor company? i feel that I know so little about the entire process and my coordinator is not very hands on or good at communicating<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I'm piggy backing on KerriAnn5's response. We did a request form some months ago but never heard back from anyone. So when we asked about it we were told that you would only hear back if your request was denied. But I have been telling my fianc\u00a9e that I really think that it comes down to money. Meaning that if I have the Element Terrace approved with my 55 guests and someone comes along with 100 guests......I am going to get bumped. Now that is just my opinion but money talks. When we visit next week I hope to have a firmer commitment on my locations after we meet with our WC.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> P.S. I'm a guy....just call me an\u00a0\"active groom\"! lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"468e24ccee494b1b49cf90bc943113e9","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]s2bebride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Also when is everyone sending out invitations, I saw somewhere that you have to have numbers confirmed and everything paid 60 days out, so does that mean replies need to be in 2 months before hand as well, it just seems so early to send invites out 4 months ahead of time?[\/quote] \n We sent our save the dates out in early January 2013......a year out from our wedding. In the save the date we had all the information that they needed to book their trip with our travel agency under our contract number. They had until March 15th to make their first payment. We chose to do it this way because it would give us an initial count as to how many people \"planned\" to come. We also set up a second payment due date for mid September with the balance being due by mid-November. We will send out formal invitations after the mid-September payment which will be four months from the wedding. The way I see it.....if they don&#039;t pay by September 15th they aren&#039;t coming because their are penalties associated with cancelling after that point due to our contract with Apple Travels. If you provide me an e-mail address I can share the Save the Dates that we chose that people really liked. \n \n Barry","Attachments":[],"Id":1776948,"PostDate":1373466208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>s2bebride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Also when is everyone sending out invitations, I saw somewhere that you have to have numbers confirmed and everything paid 60 days out, so does that mean replies need to be in 2 months before hand as well, it just seems so early to send invites out 4 months ahead of time?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> We sent our save the dates out in early January 2013......a year out from our wedding.\u00a0In the save the date we had all the\u00a0information that they needed to book their trip with our travel agency under our contract number. They had until March 15th to make their first payment. We chose to do it this way because it would give us an initial count as to how many people\u00a0\"planned\" to\u00a0come. We also set up a second payment due date for mid September with the balance being due by mid-November. We will send out formal invitations after the mid-September payment which will be four months from the wedding. The way I see it.....if they don't pay by September 15th they aren't coming because their are penalties associated with cancelling after that point due to our contract with Apple Travels. If you provide me an e-mail address I can share the Save the Dates that we chose that people really liked.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Barry<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf2ddf6ebba403ff3eda68485b2a51ac","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Lotty2012&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m piggy backing on KerriAnn5&#039;s response. We did a request form some months ago but never heard back from anyone. So when we asked about it we were told that you would only hear back if your request was denied. But I have been telling my fianc\u00a9e that I really think that it comes down to money. Meaning that if I have the Element Terrace approved with my 55 guests and someone comes along with 100 guests......I am going to get bumped. Now that is just my opinion but money talks. When we visit next week I hope to have a firmer commitment on my locations after we meet with our WC.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;P.S. I&#039;m a guy....just call me an \"active groom\"! lol&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; I e mailed Lisa and asked her to confirm all of the locations for me and she did. I got an e mail stating the time and location of all my private events as well as pricing for each because i extended the time for my welcome party and for my reception. You have to be very forceful with them for confirmations and make sure you keep record of what they send you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1777057,"PostDate":1373477535,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Lotty2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p>I'm piggy backing on KerriAnn5's response. We did a request form some months ago but never heard back from anyone. So when we asked about it we were told that you would only hear back if your request was denied. But I have been telling my fianc\u00a9e that I really think that it comes down to money. Meaning that if I have the Element Terrace approved with my 55 guests and someone comes along with 100 guests......I am going to get bumped. Now that is just my opinion but money talks. When we visit next week I hope to have a firmer commitment on my locations after we meet with our WC.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>P.S. I'm a guy....just call me an\u00a0\"active groom\"! lol<\/p><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> I e mailed Lisa and asked her to confirm all of the locations for me and she did. I got an e mail stating the time and location of all my private events as well as pricing for each because i extended the time for my welcome party and for my reception. You have to be very forceful with them for confirmations and make sure you keep record of what they send you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1174b980ac238dad364c833600d763c4","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KerriAnn5[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I e mailed Lisa and asked her to confirm all of the locations for me and she did. I got an e mail stating the time and location of all my private events as well as pricing for each because i extended the time for my welcome party and for my reception. You have to be very forceful with them for confirmations and make sure you keep record of what they send you![\/quote] \n Thanks KerriAnn. We do have an e-mail confirming that the hotel did approved the locations. But I still have my reservations about things. I will get a better feel next week because we will be taking all of our paperwork.","Attachments":[],"Id":1777287,"PostDate":1373509509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KerriAnn5<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> I e mailed Lisa and asked her to confirm all of the locations for me and she did. I got an e mail stating the time and location of all my private events as well as pricing for each because i extended the time for my welcome party and for my reception. You have to be very forceful with them for confirmations and make sure you keep record of what they send you!<\/blockquote> <p> Thanks KerriAnn. We do have an e-mail confirming that the hotel did approved the locations. But I still have my reservations about things. I will get a better feel next week because we will be taking all of our paperwork.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa2c4ef26d58f42c18217d1d4923d3bb","RawContent":"Does anyone have enough rooms to qualify for the free private functions and the 7 free nights? I was wondering how we get credit for the 7 nights free. My TA said that the resort will probably send her a check and then she will give it to me. I heard someone else say that they do the credit at check out?","Attachments":[],"Id":1777428,"PostDate":1373559580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Does anyone have enough rooms to qualify for the free private functions and the 7 free nights? I was wondering how we get credit for the 7 nights free. My TA said that the resort will probably send her a check and then she will give it to me. I heard someone else say that they do the credit at check out?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f903798eeb090c3414e27da9aad70a1e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have been working with Jasprit at L&#039;escape Destination weddings in Toronto and she has been fantastic! I&#039;m getting married April 10th at HR punta Cana... i&#039;m getting my rates for&amp;nbsp;roughly $1700&amp;nbsp;per&amp;nbsp;person based on&amp;nbsp;double occupancy.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You should give her a call - her rates are great too :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What are you doing for a photographer? are you planning on bringing&amp;nbsp;one from Toronto? I&#039;m interested in sharing a photographer so i can split the costs with another bride... anyone in? :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1777845,"PostDate":1373643402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have been working with Jasprit at L'escape Destination weddings in Toronto and she has been fantastic! I'm getting married April 10th at HR punta Cana... i'm getting my rates for\u00a0roughly $1700\u00a0per\u00a0person based on\u00a0double occupancy.<\/p> <p> You should give her a call - her rates are great too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are you doing for a photographer? are you planning on bringing\u00a0one from Toronto? I'm interested in sharing a photographer so i can split the costs with another bride... anyone in? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mckee.meghan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.42.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373643216,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meghan2424","Id":271467,"Name":"meghan2424","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47edcea4ba2b912dceb2e7329e435237","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi AngBN.... Congrats on your engagement... i&#039;m so happy to see you&#039;re getting married the day after me!!!!! I&#039;m looking for a photographer too and i&#039;m trying so hard to keep my costs down but WILL NOT cheap out on my photographer... i&#039;ll have those pics forever and want them to be amazing!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I live in Toronto and looking to bring someone down with me... would you be willing to split on the costs for them to fly down?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1777847,"PostDate":1373643604,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi AngBN.... Congrats on your engagement... i'm so happy to see you're getting married the day after me!!!!! I'm looking for a photographer too and i'm trying so hard to keep my costs down but WILL NOT cheap out on my photographer... i'll have those pics forever and want them to be amazing!<\/p> <p> I live in Toronto and looking to bring someone down with me... would you be willing to split on the costs for them to fly down?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mckee.meghan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.42.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373643216,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meghan2424","Id":271467,"Name":"meghan2424","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"069dd89c92c1fdba868fa093a55ef0d0","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AngBN[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n We are getting married at HRPC on April 11\/2014. Yay! Rates are pricey but we really wanted this resort so pushed our TA and we got prices we could live with. Our choice was between HRPC and Dreams (apparently both resorts have all food tendered by USA Costco). Based on a friend&#039;s experience getting married at HRPC in 2012, the resort credit and the overall resort amenities we decided on HRPC.\n We are dealing Mia in Miami as well and she seems really helpful so far. Struggling with which photographer to use? Any advice? Congrats to everyone on your engagements and upcoming weddings :) Happy planning[\/quote] \n \n Hi AngBN, \n Congrats on your engagement!!! :) \n I&#039;m getting married at HRPC April 10th!!! I want to get a photographer here in Toronto(where i live) and fly them down to shoot my wedding. I&#039;m looking for a bride to share these costs with me. Would you be interested? I have read a lot of the blogs and i&#039;m somewhat concerned with using a photographer i don&#039;t know. \n Let me know at your earliest please \n Thanks, \n Meghan","Attachments":[],"Id":1777920,"PostDate":1373655054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AngBN<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We are getting married at HRPC on April 11\/2014. Yay! Rates are pricey but we really wanted this resort so pushed our TA and we got prices we could live with. Our choice was between HRPC and Dreams (apparently both resorts have all food tendered by USA Costco). Based on a friend's experience getting married at HRPC in 2012, the resort credit and the overall resort amenities we decided on HRPC.<br \/> We are dealing Mia in Miami as well and she seems really helpful so far. Struggling with which photographer to use? Any advice? Congrats to everyone on your engagements and upcoming weddings <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Happy planning<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi AngBN,<\/p> <p> Congrats on your engagement!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> I'm getting married at HRPC April 10th!!! I want to get a photographer here in Toronto(where i live) and fly them down to shoot my wedding. I'm looking for a bride to share these costs with me. Would you be interested? I have read a lot of the blogs and i'm somewhat concerned with using a photographer i don't know.<\/p> <p> Let me know at your earliest please<\/p> <p> Thanks,<\/p> <p> Meghan<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mckee.meghan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.42.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373643216,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meghan2424","Id":271467,"Name":"meghan2424","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
