{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89f7f857abca435d93abef73260f3bda","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KerriAnn5[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Does anyone have enough rooms to qualify for the free private functions and the 7 free nights? I was wondering how we get credit for the 7 nights free. My TA said that the resort will probably send her a check and then she will give it to me. I heard someone else say that they do the credit at check out?[\/quote] \n KerriAnn5, check your inbox. I will share with the group when my fiancee can find the link to how it works and some things to avoid.","Attachments":[],"Id":1777997,"PostDate":1373672082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KerriAnn5<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Does anyone have enough rooms to qualify for the free private functions and the 7 free nights? I was wondering how we get credit for the 7 nights free. My TA said that the resort will probably send her a check and then she will give it to me. I heard someone else say that they do the credit at check out?<\/blockquote> <p> KerriAnn5, check your inbox. I will share with the group when my fiancee can find the link to how it works and some things to avoid.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c425210b0f180fe7323bc59e523a9c9d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anyone find their Photographer? I want a good one and I don&#039;t know what to do... Can someone give me option? I am getting married May 16 2014 at HRPC!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1778615,"PostDate":1373902894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anyone find their Photographer? I want a good one and I don't know what to do... Can someone give me option? I am getting married May 16 2014 at HRPC!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kiki_2289@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.5.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351909285,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262025.jpg?_r=1407945054","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kiki2289","Id":262025,"Name":"kiki2289","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b6cc86e5e85cc9aa399cd938466f68f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for your information, Im going to hassle my coordinator soon, to get some plans into place! &amp;nbsp;You guys are a wealth of information : )&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1778871,"PostDate":1373929477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you so much for your information, Im going to hassle my coordinator soon, to get some plans into place! \u00a0You guys are a wealth of information : )<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevie@knights.ucf.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368202143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269473.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s2bebride","Id":269473,"Name":"s2bebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"090bfb86d4fdb50fb76082c464ddaf2a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Kiki, Im going with Katya Nova photography, I highly recommend her. &amp;nbsp;Her work is gorgeous and she is super responsive and helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1778873,"PostDate":1373929657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Kiki, Im going with Katya Nova photography, I highly recommend her. \u00a0Her work is gorgeous and she is super responsive and helpful!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevie@knights.ucf.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368202143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269473.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s2bebride","Id":269473,"Name":"s2bebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5d62c07c16ad40a7d708120aff2fe95","RawContent":"I went with HDC because of all their great reviews. I wish I had known about katya because her work looks beautiful!","Attachments":[],"Id":1778996,"PostDate":1373974649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I went with HDC because of all their great reviews. I wish I had known about katya because her work looks beautiful!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47bb0cbb026f0079194acb6ede66ef8c","RawContent":"Any other march brides out there?","Attachments":[],"Id":1778997,"PostDate":1373974688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Any other march brides out there?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.oliver1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346712999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259947.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriAnn5","Id":259947,"Name":"KerriAnn5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88acead52f77ce68181fcc8b54930de8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(238, 130, 238);\"&gt;Hello ladies, I am also a 2014 bride. My fiancee and I have not booked our resort yet. We are working with our travel agent on pricing for HRPC. I am uber excited about this resort and am optimistic my TA will be able to get our package prices this week so I can reserve our date. I am happy I found this site, it appears to be a good resource. I look forward to picking your brains, getting and sharing information. Congrats Bride &lt;span alt=\":woot:\" id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374029798466_718\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"27\" id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374029798466_717\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" width=\"42\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779394,"PostDate":1374030280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(238, 130, 238)\">Hello ladies, I am also a 2014 bride. My fiancee and I have not booked our resort yet. We are working with our travel agent on pricing for HRPC. I am uber excited about this resort and am optimistic my TA will be able to get our package prices this week so I can reserve our date. I am happy I found this site, it appears to be a good resource. I look forward to picking your brains, getting and sharing information. Congrats Bride <span alt=\":woot:\" id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374029798466_718\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"27\" id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374029798466_717\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" width=\"42\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374024932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfb3689c81e3092af43a4d710ce02474","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KerriAnn5[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I went with HDC because of all their great reviews. I wish I had known about katya because her work looks beautiful![\/quote] \n Do you have Katya&#039;s information?","Attachments":[],"Id":1779396,"PostDate":1374030418,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KerriAnn5<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I went with HDC because of all their great reviews. I wish I had known about katya because her work looks beautiful!<\/blockquote> <p> Do you have Katya's information?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374024932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de5c3339a3f21279b4a7cebecf5b5cd3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; So I emailed my coordinator and no surprise, I was told there is no listing of private even locations only, beach, gazebo, terrace, or ballroom option. Also that my exact location will be confirmed when I arrive at the resort....ugh!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779621,"PostDate":1374084021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So I emailed my coordinator and no surprise, I was told there is no listing of private even locations only, beach, gazebo, terrace, or ballroom option. Also that my exact location will be confirmed when I arrive at the resort....ugh!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevie@knights.ucf.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368202143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269473.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoH