{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c7608a36bfa4c1e8fe839f27f89275a","RawContent":"Thanks for the info Kerriann5 I&#039;ve been trying to find out if the credit could be used on hair n make up. It&#039;s unfortunate that you can&#039;t thou :( definitely would have come in handy. Especially since I&#039;m thinking of doing a hair trial. We&#039;ve still been struggling with deciding on a photographer. After reading all tge reviews on the site and talking with several companies We have decided to go with HDC! So excited everything is coming together. Good luck all","Attachments":[],"Id":1797683,"PostDate":1378342730,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the info Kerriann5 I've been trying to find out if the credit could be used on hair n make up. It's unfortunate that you can't thou <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> definitely would have come in handy. Especially since I'm thinking of doing a hair trial. We've still been struggling with deciding on a photographer. After reading all tge reviews on the site and talking with several companies We have decided to go with HDC! So excited everything is coming together. Good luck all\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ahackett75@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"156.34.10.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370214506,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270200.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngBN","Id":270200,"Name":"AngBN","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75082564cabf0daa598832a25fca7264","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;AngBN&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Thanks for the info Kerriann5 I&#039;ve been trying to find out if the credit could be used on hair n make up. It&#039;s unfortunate that you can&#039;t thou &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" \/&gt; definitely would have come in handy. Especially since I&#039;m thinking of doing a hair trial.\n We&#039;ve still been struggling with deciding on a photographer. After reading all tge reviews on the site and talking with several companies We have decided to go with HDC! So excited everything is coming together. Good luck all&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;AngBN, I also went with HDC. I&#039;m excited to work with them. I loved their profile and the prices were reasonable. I see you&#039;re an April bride as well. If you don&#039;t mind me asking, what is your date and what resort are you getting married at?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1797696,"PostDate":1378345647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>AngBN<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thanks for the info Kerriann5 I've been trying to find out if the credit could be used on hair n make up. It's unfortunate that you can't thou <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" \/><\/span> definitely would have come in handy. Especially since I'm thinking of doing a hair trial.<br \/> We've still been struggling with deciding on a photographer. After reading all tge reviews on the site and talking with several companies We have decided to go with HDC! So excited everything is coming together. Good luck all<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>AngBN, I also went with HDC. I'm excited to work with them. I loved their profile and the prices were reasonable. I see you're an April bride as well. If you don't mind me asking, what is your date and what resort are you getting married at?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374024932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3ce5fc2dd0af497c0439f7eb5891777","RawContent":"I loved their pics too! So excited to have that finalized :) Our wedding date is April 11th and we are at the Hard Rock hotel &amp; Casino for the week. So looking forward to the resort and the wedding ;) How about you? When and where?","Attachments":[],"Id":1798486,"PostDate":1378677775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I loved their pics too! So excited to have that finalized <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Our wedding date is April 11th and we are at the Hard Rock hotel & Casino for the week. So looking forward to the resort and the wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> How about you? When and where?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ahackett75@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"156.34.10.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370214506,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270200.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngBN","Id":270200,"Name":"AngBN","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"970b422df40b12701d9e6d03b9c160a4","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;AngBN&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n I loved their pics too! So excited to have that finalized :)\n Our wedding date is April 11th and we are at the Hard Rock hotel &amp;amp; Casino for the week. So looking forward to the resort and the wedding &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/&gt;\n How about you? When and where?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Sweeeeeet, our wedding date is April 12th and we are also at the Hard Rock. I&#039;m sooooooo excited.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798489,"PostDate":1378679079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>AngBN<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I loved their pics too! So excited to have that finalized <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> Our wedding date is April 11th and we are at the Hard Rock hotel & Casino for the week. So looking forward to the resort and the wedding <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> How about you? When and where?<\/div> <\/div> <p>Sweeeeeet, our wedding date is April 12th and we are also at the Hard Rock. I'm sooooooo excited.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374024932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsD