;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;Lol that&#039;s too funny a day apart and same resort. I&#039;m sure we&#039;ll see you there :)&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; I&#039;m sure. I love this site. It gives you the opportunity to meet and share ideas with people you normally wouldn&#039;t have contact with.","Attachments":[],"Id":1798987,"PostDate":1378838096,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>AngBN<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/>Lol that's too funny a day apart and same resort. I'm sure we'll see you there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> I'm sure. I love this site. It gives you the opportunity to meet and share ideas with people you normally wouldn't have contact with.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374024932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b72093f4d689faef2a319103b345eaa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I am new to this site...I am so happy I found it! I am getting married at Hard Rock Punta Cana May 15th 2014. I have never been to the hotel and am a little nervous about the decor. We have booked the beach for the ceremony and the Element terrace for the reception. Has anyone seen the Element terrace in person? Any suggestions on the decor?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1800421,"PostDate":1379359968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I am new to this site...I am so happy I found it! I am getting married at Hard Rock Punta Cana May 15th 2014. I have never been to the hotel and am a little nervous about the decor. We have booked the beach for the ceremony and the Element terrace for the reception. Has anyone seen the Element terrace in person? Any suggestions on the decor?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jess_lambert_13@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379359618,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273516.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessicarachel","Id":273516,"Name":"jessicarachel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4456903d996c222921e28895671f6cfa","RawContent":"Hi ladies, My wedding date is July 11, 2014 I&#039;m so excited !! I was working with Mia Mendoza but she no longer works with hard rock Is anyone working with Banetzer roger?","Attachments":[],"Id":1802610,"PostDate":1380104076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies, My wedding date is July 11, 2014 I'm so excited !! I was working with Mia Mendoza but she no longer works with hard rock Is anyone working with Banetzer roger?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krystleashley923@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380103150,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273755.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krystlex3","Id":273755,"Name":"krystlex3","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a55461bcdb5fe4efc9ad2c09eea2cf23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi HRPC,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Are there any brides who have recently had a wedding or been to one at HRPC?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I am struggling because I am not able to visit and have to decide this weekend!&amp;nbsp;I would really like to know the following from a bride:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;-Will the party scene be too much for my older family members?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;-Is there a quiet area of the resort?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;-Are the outdoor&amp;nbsp;receptions does in a classy, elegant, and intimate manner?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I LOVE the wedding blogs I see, but the actual website concerns me. I think I&#039;m just over-worrying. Thank you so much for your help!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Tara&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1803273,"PostDate":1380314725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi HRPC,<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Are there any brides who have recently had a wedding or been to one at HRPC?<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I am struggling because I am not able to visit and have to decide this weekend!\u00a0I would really like to know the following from a bride:<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>-Will the party scene be too much for my older family members?<\/p> <p>-Is there a quiet area of the resort?<\/p> <p>-Are the outdoor\u00a0receptions does in a classy, elegant, and intimate manner?<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I LOVE the wedding blogs I see, but the actual website concerns me. I think I'm just over-worrying. Thank you so much for your help!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Tara<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taralhall2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371493814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270662.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":174,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TaraHall","Id":270662,"Name":"TaraHall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53fa67ea378941cee8afe952f7a34247","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Ktonder&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Does anyone have pictures of the different pools for reception areas? I have seen many pictures but none with names (other than the eden pool)...Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Hello Ktonder, Did anyone ever send you these? I am looking for the same! Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1803282,"PostDate":1380317722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Ktonder<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Does anyone have pictures of the different pools for reception areas? I have seen many pictures but none with names (other than the eden pool)...Thanks!!<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Hello Ktonder, Did anyone ever send you these? I am looking for the same! Thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taralhall2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371493814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270662.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":174,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TaraHall","Id":270662,"Name":"TaraHall","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":140,"NextPage":150,"PreviousPage":130,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
