Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a2cf19853d8edbeea40ecb3e87ce8be","RawContent":"I am getting married on 2-21-2014. I was so disappointed in my first WC but I got reassigned and my new one is great and I am so excited!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1807351,"PostDate":1381874559,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married on 2-21-2014. I was so disappointed in my first WC but I got reassigned and my new one is great and I am so excited!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kwalton8989@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381874373,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274282.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kaylamatt22114","Id":274282,"Name":"kaylamatt22114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3efa67166e7d381b098184f694f0f9c6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"sbowie\"]\nI am strongly considering HR as my resort for my wedding.  I wanted to get married on May 18, 2014, but found out that it could only be a symbolic ceremony.&lt;img alt=\"sad.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_884\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"[\/url] style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\" name=\"user_yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_884\"&gt;   I have moved it to the 17th instead.  I have gotten some good information from the resort.  What wedding packages are you ladies looking at, if any? What made you choose this resort over others? Congrats and Happy Planning!![\/quote] I chose to do a symbolic due to all of the paperwork that is required and just do a justice ceremony in the states before we leave.","Attachments":[],"Id":1807353,"PostDate":1381874714,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"sbowie\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides#post_1828221\"><p>I am strongly considering HR as my resort for my wedding.\u00a0 I wanted to get married on May 18, 2014, but found out that it could only be a symbolic ceremony.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"sad.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_884\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\" name=\"user_yui_3_5_1_1_1351181008137_884\"><\/span> \u00a0 I have moved it to the 17th instead.\u00a0 I have gotten some good information from the resort.\u00a0 What wedding packages are you ladies looking at, if any? What made you choose this resort over others? Congrats and Happy Planning!!<\/p><\/blockquote> I chose to do a symbolic due to all of the paperwork that is required and just do a justice ceremony in the states before we leave.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kwalton8989@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381874373,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274282.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kaylamatt22114","Id":274282,"Name":"kaylamatt22114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2bb7d8263feb6977407398a41bf07d4d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"alycamille\"]\nMy first post! We have finally booked for February 2014!!! So excited! Does anyone else have Mia Mendoza as their coordinator? I&#039;m guessing that she is new to the Miami office as I haven&#039;t heard about her before.  [\/quote] Hi!! We are getting married on 2\/21\/14. Originally I had Mia. She was a terror to work with and must&#039;ve gotten fired because I&#039;m now working with Christina and she&#039;s been awesome. I&#039;ve hammered out every detail except the menu! So excited for all of us brides. We are staying there for 10 total days so it&#039;s our honeymoon spot as well :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1807357,"PostDate":1381875299,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"alycamille\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides#post_1863316\"><p>My first post! We have finally booked for February 2014!!! So excited! Does anyone else have Mia Mendoza as their coordinator? I'm guessing that she is new to the Miami office as I haven't heard about her before. \u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> Hi!! We are getting married on 2\/21\/14. Originally I had Mia. She was a terror to work with and must've gotten fired because I'm now working with Christina and she's been awesome. I've hammered out every detail except the menu! So excited for all of us brides. We are staying there for 10 total days so it's our honeymoon spot as well <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kwalton8989@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381874373,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274282.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kaylamatt22114","Id":274282,"Name":"kaylamatt22114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62d58b8f3ea02864413e49c87e53e282","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi girls!! My fianc\u00a9 and I are looking at Hard Rock for our 2015 destination wedding! We&#039;ve looked at a few other resorts, but this seems to be the one we like best!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll have around 30-35 guests, and will do the complimentary wedding with the restaurant dinner. We want to have a reception though! Just curious if the free private events can be used toward a private reception? And if not, is the price outrageous? We&#039;d just want like 3 hours to drink, dance, and celebrate with friends &amp;amp; family!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Also - does anybody have pictures of ceremony locations, decorations and reception locations!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Clearly, we haven&#039;t planned anything yet! So any help is soooooo appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807542,"PostDate":1381947270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi girls!! My fianc\u00a9 and I are looking at Hard Rock for our 2015 destination wedding! We've looked at a few other resorts, but this seems to be the one we like best!\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>We'll have around 30-35 guests, and will do the complimentary wedding with the restaurant dinner. We want to have a reception though! Just curious if the free private events can be used toward a private reception? And if not, is the price outrageous? We'd just want like 3 hours to drink, dance, and celebrate with friends & family!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Also - does anybody have pictures of ceremony locations, decorations and reception locations!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Clearly, we haven't planned anything yet! So any help is soooooo appreciated!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristind51989@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.61.89.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381943486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274302.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":98,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kvilagi","Id":274302,"Name":"kvilagi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c44c03fddb246f3bd27a84d0b18f61ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are 98% sure we are going through Katya and Rob who are in the DM part of the year! Her pictures are amazing, she is on FB and Instagram and has a website.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807664,"PostDate":1381978610,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are 98% sure we are going through Katya and Rob who are in the DM part of the year! Her pictures are amazing, she is on FB and Instagram and has a website.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hockymom13@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376774031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272682.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skicker","Id":272682,"Name":"skicker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f9382d4a2d2076ae4ec752d0b6285ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies! I was just wondering what rate you got for HR? I am looking into it for my wedding and will have between 25-30 people. I have only gone to a few travel agents but they all come back with $2,500 per person and I am not too sure if that is right as I can get that very same price myself online.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807819,"PostDate":1382039341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies! I was just wondering what rate you got for HR? I am looking into it for my wedding and will have between 25-30 people. I have only gone to a few travel agents but they all come back with $2,500 per person and I am not too sure if that is right as I can get that very same price myself online.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krisdaversa@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.29.31.208","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382039086,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274333.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krisdaversa","Id":274333,"Name":"krisdaversa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f7163e51e0802c66a199417faa44894","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thats for the info I am going to check out that TA as I am not too far from there and $1,700 is an awesome price!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m flying my photgraphers down&amp;nbsp; I only have to pay their fee $1,200 and they pay their own way. I get them the full day plus a trash the dress the next day or just a regular photoshoot :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807825,"PostDate":1382040233,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thats for the info I am going to check out that TA as I am not too far from there and $1,700 is an awesome price!\u00a0 I'm flying my photgraphers down\u00a0 I only have to pay their fee $1,200 and they pay their own way. I get them the full day plus a trash the dress the next day or just a regular photoshoot :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krisdaversa@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.29.31.208","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382039086,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274333.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krisdaversa","Id":274333,"Name":"krisdaversa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90cc611494b522feeee8b3d8b83eaa9e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have submitted request for my wedding date &amp;amp; still haven&#039;t heard back form any one do you have an e-mail for christina, i want to get moving &amp;amp; now i&#039;m getting nervous&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1811523,"PostDate":1383504234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have submitted request for my wedding date & still haven't heard back form any one do you have an e-mail for christina, i want to get moving & now i'm getting nervous<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kymfass@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1383504104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274794.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KymandKyle","Id":274794,"Name":"KymandKyle","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0912b139f9f392aab94f17acf1e42069","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI Girls this is my first Post! We are looking at june of 2015 at the HR, i know it seems like a time a way but i want to get started Early. &amp;nbsp; I have been sending in request &amp;amp; i haven&#039;t heard from any one yet? does any one have a WC they love working with i just want my date to be reserved &amp;amp; i can relax from there? &amp;nbsp; &lt;em&gt;PLEASE HELP!&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1811526,"PostDate":1383504577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI Girls this is my first Post! We are looking at june of 2015 at the HR, i know it seems like a time a way but i want to get started Early. \u00a0 I have been sending in request & i haven't heard from any one yet? does any one have a WC they love working with i just want my date to be reserved & i can relax from there? \u00a0 <em>PLEASE HELP!<\/em><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kymfass@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1383504104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274794.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KymandKyle","Id":274794,"Name":"KymandKyle","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4e9144875d42f61328b717b0ce9d7d4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KerriAnn5\"]\nHi ladies! So just an FYI I recently needed to add more rooms to my group contract and I was told by the resort that once I went over 20 rooms that all of my guest would lose their resort credits. I didn&#039;t believe them so I looked at my contract and it was in fact written in there! So. My TA dealt with them and got it removed from my contact. The moral here is if you have more than 20 rooms check your contracts![\/quote]Thanks for this info!","Attachments":[],"Id":1811919,"PostDate":1383659822,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"KerriAnn5\" url=\"\/t\/82198\/2014&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana&#045;dr&#045;brides\/120#post_1939952\"><p>Hi ladies! So just an FYI I recently needed to add more rooms to my group contract and I was told by the resort that once I went over 20 rooms that all of my guest would lose their resort credits. I didn't believe them so I looked at my contract and it was in fact written in there! So. My TA dealt with them and got it removed from my contact. The moral here is if you have more than 20 rooms check your contracts!<\/p><\/blockquote>Thanks for this info!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seggal@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381724547,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274224.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alexandra66","Id":274224,"Name":"Alexandra66","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":160,"NextPage":170,"PreviousPage":150,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
