{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"120cfff8de3b4fd1a7383db9be6572f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; I am&amp;nbsp;new to this, but i&amp;nbsp;would be considered a 2015 HRPC DR Bride. My travel agent recommended this resort to me and so far I am&amp;nbsp;in love with it. I&amp;nbsp;found this site by accident and I have to say that u guys have been very helpful. How are the 2014 prices? Any advice or recommendations?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1817424,"PostDate":1385648855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies<\/p> <p>\u00a0 \u00a0 I am\u00a0new to this, but i\u00a0would be considered a 2015 HRPC DR Bride. My travel agent recommended this resort to me and so far I am\u00a0in love with it. I\u00a0found this site by accident and I have to say that u guys have been very helpful. How are the 2014 prices? Any advice or recommendations?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smorales612@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.206.63.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385647740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275371.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smorales","Id":275371,"Name":"smorales","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.208.70.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b72812bba0c7e3ce6e0cf6f4b55f79f","RawContent":"Hi Ladies! I think I am going to have my wedding at one of the Hard Rocks but can&#039;t decide which one... punta cana, vallarta, or riviera maya??? \n\n\nIt seems like packages, promos and all wedding related stuff are the same at all three. Can anyone give me advice? We are going to do a site visit to one location so I have to pick. Help please! (We are all coming from nyc area)\n\n\nThanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1819076,"PostDate":1386867585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies! I think I am going to have my wedding at one of the Hard Rocks but can't decide which one... punta cana, vallarta, or riviera maya??? <br><br>\nIt seems like packages, promos and all wedding related stuff are the same at all three. Can anyone give me advice? We are going to do a site visit to one location so I have to pick. Help please! (We are all coming from nyc area)<br><br>\nThanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bridewendyp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.208.70.119","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386865990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275601.jpg?_r=1390193920","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wendyp","Id":275601,"Name":"Wendyp","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d700f4dae1349b925d8fe4bd9d680d4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve stayed here twice and just organized a group trip for 20 of my friends in August. &amp;nbsp;Very familiar with this resort and do believe it has something for everyone (unless you want a small intimate resort). &amp;nbsp;Let me know if you have any questions about the resort or doing a group block!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1820378,"PostDate":1388001608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies! \u00a0I've stayed here twice and just organized a group trip for 20 of my friends in August. \u00a0Very familiar with this resort and do believe it has something for everyone (unless you want a small intimate resort). \u00a0Let me know if you have any questions about the resort or doing a group block!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"barbara@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"69.57.225.114","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1325616705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249263.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Babs","Id":249263,"Name":"TA Babs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.82.240.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1bbbf5ce8139652c0a2ddcca76126f0","RawContent":"Has anyone used the photography service offered through the hard rock, if so how were they? My wedding is in March, not sure if we should use them or someone outside. Thanks for your help!","Attachments":[],"Id":1821291,"PostDate":1388522941,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anyone used the photography service offered through the hard rock, if so how were they? My wedding is in March, not sure if we should use them or someone outside. Thanks for your help!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"biminih@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"71.82.240.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388522674,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Biminih","Id":275806,"Name":"Biminih","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.34.10.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"975cae8b025ebe8dd9a6ad9cfcde2a9d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m trying to figure out what to bring with us for decor?. We&#039;re getting married at the Hard Rock in April 2014, and they&#039;ve given us vendor info for decorations but they are both pricey. I know it would be cheaper to get the decorations here at home and bring it with us but will they let us use it? Will they let us set it up? Or will the resort charge us to set it up? Does anyone know?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823417,"PostDate":1389039754,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm trying to figure out what to bring with us for decor?. We're getting married at the Hard Rock in April 2014, and they've given us vendor info for decorations but they are both pricey. I know it would be cheaper to get the decorations here at home and bring it with us but will they let us use it? Will they let us set it up? Or will the resort charge us to set it up? Does anyone know?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ahackett75@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"156.34.10.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370214506,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270200.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngBN","Id":270200,"Name":"AngBN","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e23c58292c44d945df9b86227c57e9b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AngBN\" post=\"1823417\" timestamp=\"1389039754\"]\nI&#039;m trying to figure out what to bring with us for decor?. We&#039;re getting married at the Hard Rock in April 2014, and they&#039;ve given us vendor info for decorations but they are both pricey. I know it would be cheaper to get the decorations here at home and bring it with us but will they let us use it? Will they let us set it up? Or will the resort charge us to set it up? Does anyone know?[\/quote]\nYou can bring your own decorations but there is a set up fee. Some things they will do for you without a fee (i.e lay out your programs) but things like chair covers, they will charge you a fee. At least that&#039;s what my wedding coordinator told me.","Attachments":[],"Id":1824200,"PostDate":1389215871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AngBN, on 06 January 2014 - 12:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm trying to figure out what to bring with us for decor?. We're getting married at the Hard Rock in April 2014, and they've given us vendor info for decorations but they are both pricey. I know it would be cheaper to get the decorations here at home and bring it with us but will they let us use it? Will they let us set it up? Or will the resort charge us to set it up? Does anyone know?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can bring your own decorations but there is a set up fee. Some things they will do for you without a fee (i.e lay out your programs) but things like chair covers, they will charge you a fee. At least that's what my wedding coordinator told me.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374024932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"670a152394369227263d6cd7cd14d2c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies! My wife and I just got back from the HRPC. After a year and a half of planning as a couple I am happy to say that our wedding went off without a hitch and everything was perfect. We were both very pleased.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am willing to answer any questions and gave guidance because we sure got a lot of information from this blog and those on FB. I&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you all for accepting an active groom in he group!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1828645,"PostDate":1390604770,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies! My wife and I just got back from the HRPC. After a year and a half of planning as a couple I am happy to say that our wedding went off without a hitch and everything was perfect. We were both very pleased.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am willing to answer any questions and gave guidance because we sure got a lot of information from this blog and those on FB. I<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you all for accepting an active groom in he group!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barrylott@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.225.188.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350910643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261626.jpg?_r=1394634283","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lotty2012","Id":261626,"Name":"Lotty2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.69.137.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"742984b2571999ab3f59388e49a62f68","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Hi everyone&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;I am getting Married on may 16 2014 its coming up soon.. the only thing I have to do is the DJ..Di anyone use the hard rock DJ?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;How was it?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;I am getting married at 5 o&#039;clock and cocktail at 6 and dinner at 7? I feel its enough time for picture but I am not sure for the guest is it a to long to wait??&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;What are you guys doing for your time?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;And I have the dj book from 6 to 10:30...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836000,"PostDate":1393607482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hi everyone<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">I am getting Married on may 16 2014 its coming up soon.. the only thing I have to do is the DJ..Di anyone use the hard rock DJ?<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">How was it?<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">I am getting married at 5 o'clock and cocktail at 6 and dinner at 7? I feel its enough time for picture but I am not sure for the guest is it a to long to wait??\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">What are you guys doing for your time?<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">And I have the dj book from 6 to 10:30...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kiki_2289@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.5.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351909285,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262025.jpg?_r=1407945054","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kiki2289","Id":262025,"Name":"kiki2289","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.80.232.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f726b38eeb2692ab4ed8e786af7700c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lotty2012\"] oooo do&amp;nbsp; you have any pictures of your wedding? We have been to HRDR for vacation and now want to have our wedding there in 2016 but was trying to get more information. If you dont mind me asking how many people you ended up having and an estimate of how much the wedding ended up costing. Im trying to figure out how much it might cost us for 60 people.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any help from anyone is greatly appreciated. thanks a bunch.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tam&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837457,"PostDate":1394407833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"261626\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/261626-lotty2012\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lotty2012<\/span><\/a> oooo do\u00a0 you have any pictures of your wedding? We have been to HRDR for vacation and now want to have our wedding there in 2016 but was trying to get more information. If you dont mind me asking how many people you ended up having and an estimate of how much the wedding ended up costing. Im trying to figure out how much it might cost us for 60 people.<\/p>\n<p>Any help from anyone is greatly appreciated. thanks a bunch.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tam<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"btamwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.80.232.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391461699,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"btam","Id":276480,"Name":"btam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8548a82384772fe53ec288a3149387f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;when booking under a membership does anyone have suggestions as to what area of the resort to book- we are planning a reunion trip... we got married in 2012 at Moon Palace- so we are used to big resorts! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Is there anywhere that gives you a little view of the ocean from your room?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837522,"PostDate":1394471293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>when booking under a membership does anyone have suggestions as to what area of the resort to book- we are planning a reunion trip... we got married in 2012 at Moon Palace- so we are used to big resorts! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is there anywhere that gives you a little view of the ocean from your room?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":170,"NextPage":180,"PreviousPage":160,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
