{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.75.11.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a380ee1f62a661c8f61b8185c688d7d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hello!!!&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hoping to get some guidance from anyone who has gotten married or is getting married at the Hard Rock in Punta Cana, Dominican Republic.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;My current issue of the day is offering my guests local \/ near by resorts as alternate options to staying at the Hard Rock Punta Cana. Does anyone have any suggestions??? Feedback would be WONDERFUL!!! My wedding is scheduled for Feb 14 2015 and I am working with Maryln in Miami.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hoping to make some DW friends!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Cheers,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Maggie&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851617,"PostDate":1400706559,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hello!!!<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hoping to get some guidance from anyone who has gotten married or is getting married at the Hard Rock in Punta Cana, Dominican Republic.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">My current issue of the day is offering my guests local \/ near by resorts as alternate options to staying at the Hard Rock Punta Cana. Does anyone have any suggestions??? Feedback would be WONDERFUL!!! My wedding is scheduled for Feb 14 2015 and I am working with Maryln in Miami.\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hoping to make some DW friends!!\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Cheers,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Maggie\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magalla78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.75.11.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373673311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271487.jpg?_r=1400622504","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"magalla78","Id":271487,"Name":"magalla78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.250.184.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e56669d7c2998cdc617fb63a16bfa9f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lotty2012\" post=\"1828645\" timestamp=\"1390604770\"]\nHello Ladies! My wife and I just got back from the HRPC. After a year and a half of planning as a couple I am happy to say that our wedding went off without a hitch and everything was perfect. We were both very pleased. \n\nI am willing to answer any questions and gave guidance because we sure got a lot of information from this blog and those on FB. I\n\nThank you all for accepting an active groom in he group![\/quote]Hello @[member=\"Lotty2012\"] I am looking into this resort for my wedding however I am concerned about the room rates. How were the rates for your guests during your wedding? Any info is helpful, thank you","Attachments":[],"Id":1851766,"PostDate":1400782883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lotty2012, on 24 January 2014 - 03:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello Ladies! My wife and I just got back from the HRPC. After a year and a half of planning as a couple I am happy to say that our wedding went off without a hitch and everything was perfect. We were both very pleased.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am willing to answer any questions and gave guidance because we sure got a lot of information from this blog and those on FB. I<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you all for accepting an active groom in he group!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"261626\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/261626-lotty2012\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lotty2012<\/span><\/a> I am looking into this resort for my wedding however I am concerned about the room rates. How were the rates for your guests during your wedding? Any info is helpful, thank you<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nataliem87@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"71.183.231.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359317279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265176.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nataliem87","Id":265176,"Name":"nataliem87","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.108.54.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c6ef60de88d55cbd2a43af78e6a6024","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TaraHall\" post=\"1803273\" timestamp=\"1380314725\"]\nHi HRPC,\n\nAre there any brides who have recently had a wedding or been to one at HRPC?\n\nI am struggling because I am not able to visit and have to decide this weekend! I would really like to know the following from a bride:\n\n-Will the party scene be too much for my older family members?\n-Is there a quiet area of the resort?\n-Are the outdoor receptions does in a classy, elegant, and intimate manner?\n\nI LOVE the wedding blogs I see, but the actual website concerns me. I think I&#039;m just over-worrying. Thank you so much for your help!\n\nTara[\/quote]I have the same questions :\/\n[quote name=\"onelilndn\" post=\"1732980\" timestamp=\"1363146898\"]\nthanks for the info.. so so nervous to book site un seen... such an important day[\/quote]I went there to cover Rihanna&#039;s performance and decided that would be my venue. The hotel is amazing, food and spa were my favorite.  Don&#039;t worry you and your guests will LOVE it!\n[quote name=\"ErinWally\" post=\"1752970\" timestamp=\"1367419165\"]\nI&#039;m a newbie - first post.  I just booked my wedding at the HRPC for 3\/14\/14.  AngieRich, this is my biggest concern.  We want a ceremony on the beach and the reception on a terrace close to the beach.  How long after submitting your location preference form did it take for Mia to tell you that your choices are booked?  I don&#039;t want months to go by before they tell me I may be stuck at a random pool.  My coordinator tells me not to worry because the resort is so big, so I shouldn&#039;t have a problem getting one of the beach locations (Isla or Ipanema) and one of the terraces (Element or Toro).  But I can&#039;t grasp why they won&#039;t actually confirm until 30 days prior.  How is it that I&#039;ve seen examples of Save the Dates (on the All Classy FB page) where people are listing the exact beach\/reception sites? They must be sending those out several months ahead of time - are they just hoping for their requests to be met or are they getting actual confirmations?  AngieRich, something must be going on 1\/15\/14.  It&#039;s a Wednesday - how can every location be unavailable?  You might want to push for answers.  I know that the whole resort was basically sold out for a period this past January for a concert and all of their die-hard fans.[\/quote]You sound like me! lol how was your wedding day?? Do tell?! :)\n\n@[member=\"KerriAnn5\"] hey lady, sounds great and I was wondering who was your [color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]calligrapher[\/font][\/color]?","Attachments":[],"Id":1853305,"PostDate":1401732693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TaraHall, on 27 September 2013 - 12:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi HRPC,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are there any brides who have recently had a wedding or been to one at HRPC?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am struggling because I am not able to visit and have to decide this weekend!\u00a0I would really like to know the following from a bride:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-Will the party scene be too much for my older family members?<\/p>\n<p>-Is there a quiet area of the resort?<\/p>\n<p>-Are the outdoor\u00a0receptions does in a classy, elegant, and intimate manner?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I LOVE the wedding blogs I see, but the actual website concerns me. I think I'm just over-worrying. Thank you so much for your help!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tara<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I have the same questions :\/<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>onelilndn, on 12 March 2013 - 07:54 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>thanks for the info.. so so nervous to book site un seen... such an important day<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I went there to cover Rihanna's performance and decided that would be my venue. The hotel is amazing, food and spa were my favorite. \u00a0Don't worry you and your guests will LOVE it!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ErinWally, on 01 May 2013 - 06:39 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm a newbie - first post.\u00a0 I just booked my wedding at the HRPC for\u00a03\/14\/14.\u00a0 AngieRich, this is my biggest concern.\u00a0\u00a0We want\u00a0a\u00a0ceremony\u00a0on the beach and the reception on a terrace close to the beach.\u00a0\u00a0How long after submitting your location\u00a0preference\u00a0form did it take for Mia to tell\u00a0you that your choices are booked?\u00a0 I don't want months to go by before they tell me I may be stuck at a random pool.\u00a0\u00a0My coordinator tells me not to worry because the resort is so big, so I\u00a0shouldn't have a problem\u00a0getting one of the beach locations\u00a0(Isla or Ipanema) and one of the terraces (Element or Toro).\u00a0 But I can't grasp why they won't actually confirm until 30 days prior.\u00a0 How is it that I've seen examples of Save the Dates (on the All Classy FB page) where people are listing the exact beach\/reception sites? They must be sending those out several months ahead of time - are they just hoping for their requests to be met or are they getting actual confirmations?\u00a0 AngieRich, something must be going on 1\/15\/14.\u00a0 It's a Wednesday - how can every location be unavailable?\u00a0 You might want to push for answers.\u00a0 I know that the whole resort was basically sold out for a period this past January for a concert and all of their die-hard fans.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You sound like me! lol how was your wedding day?? Do tell?! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"259947\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/259947-kerriann5\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KerriAnn5<\/span><\/a> hey lady, sounds great and I was wondering who was your\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">calligrapher<\/span>?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneybrownsugar@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.108.54.133","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401202897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278132.png?_r=1405078159","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":181,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CB777","Id":278132,"Name":"CB777","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.159.192.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46518a0a13bcc98a3b1779adcdb27939","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tim and I got married at Hard Rock Punta Cana on May 16 2014.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It was amazing!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We had 30 guest and we had our wedding at on the beach and the reception at the element terrace.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I planned 1 year in advanced it was very simple and honestly it wasn&#039;t has complicated has it seems.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Everything was plan out before with Melissa Diaz. &lt;strong&gt;FYI SHE IS REALLY GOOD.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We got their on monday and we met with Melissa on the Tuesday we went over the details in a hour and that&#039;s all we had to do.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We met with a local Photographer&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Nikolay&amp;nbsp;Chernichenko on wednesday explain how it work and then that was it.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;I recommend Nikolay Chernichenko he is fast to reply very good only good comment I have.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Here&#039;s some pictures&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":29069,"Name":"10450104_10203669454411369_5951994596569592539_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-98562400-1407944408.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-98562400-1407944408_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29070,"Name":"10496238_10203669438970983_6138130848138994796_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-57887600-1407944421.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-57887600-1407944421_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29067,"Name":"906334_10203669415330392_8223730039618042990_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-61904500-1407944380.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-61904500-1407944380_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29066,"Name":"10397082_10203669488452220_4440518220281245636_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-69246200-1407944368.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-69246200-1407944368_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29071,"Name":"10536712_10203669414570373_7537840239718960860_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-73354300-1407944433.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-73354300-1407944433_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29072,"Name":"10552388_10203669430770778_2630517209369623934_n.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-08898000-1407944446.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-08898000-1407944446_thumb.jpg","Width":626,"Height":417},{"Id":29073,"Name":"10507018_10203669485572148_2031434921959989488_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-80781100-1407944464.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-80781100-1407944464_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29075,"Name":"10498637_10203669465331642_5834607876451371208_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-15125700-1407944508.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-15125700-1407944508_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29077,"Name":"10459031_10203669480332017_7464676626283591679_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-19980200-1407944545.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-19980200-1407944545_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29078,"Name":"10495585_10203669417570448_5027860554875491489_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-04969200-1407944558.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-04969200-1407944558_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":29081,"Name":"10329834_10203669450291266_30124321970987411_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-38620500-1407944669.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-262025-0-38620500-1407944669_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667}],"Id":1866042,"PostDate":1407944696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tim and I got married at Hard Rock Punta Cana on May 16 2014.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It was amazing!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We had 30 guest and we had our wedding at on the beach and the reception at the element terrace.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I planned 1 year in advanced it was very simple and honestly it wasn't has complicated has it seems.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything was plan out before with Melissa Diaz. <strong>FYI SHE IS REALLY GOOD.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We got their on monday and we met with Melissa on the Tuesday we went over the details in a hour and that's all we had to do.<\/p>\n<p>We met with a local Photographer\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:bold;\">Nikolay\u00a0Chernichenko on wednesday explain how it work and then that was it.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:bold;\">I recommend Nikolay Chernichenko he is fast to reply very good only good comment I have.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:bold;\">Here's some pictures<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kiki_2289@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.5.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351909285,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262025.jpg?_r=1407945054","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kiki2289","Id":262025,"Name":"kiki2289","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.144.199.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74866d12e92efa883ef33ae032bab5f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock&#039;s WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870568,"PostDate":1409860643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock's WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindsaymbock@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.144.199.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409858963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LMS","Id":279688,"Name":"LMS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.31.217.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5152ab26ca6f51ef86b4b61346af4ef","RawContent":"Hi, I am a 2015 bride. Anyone have a hard time with the Miami office? It&#039;s like pulling teeth to get anything figured out. I have sent over my deposit beginning of last week, did not hear anything back for a whole week. I emailed the lady asking if she had everything and if it was all ok cause she had yet to run my card and she sent me one back saying \" she will have a conformation for me shortly.\" Well needless to say it&#039;s been 2 days since then and when I call I only get an automated voice telling me \" is on the phone\".. I&#039;m clueless and nervous! I just wanna get past the Miami office and speak with someone in PC, but, for me it is seeming difficult!!!    Is it only me or have others had trouble with them?","Attachments":[],"Id":1872041,"PostDate":1410931351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, I am a 2015 bride. Anyone have a hard time with the Miami office? It's like pulling teeth to get anything figured out. I have sent over my deposit beginning of last week, did not hear anything back for a whole week. I emailed the lady asking if she had everything and if it was all ok cause she had yet to run my card and she sent me one back saying \" she will have a conformation for me shortly.\" Well needless to say it's been 2 days since then and when I call I only get an automated voice telling me \" is on the phone\".. I'm clueless and nervous! I just wanna get past the Miami office and speak with someone in PC, but, for me it is seeming difficult!!!    Is it only me or have others had trouble with them?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nick.and.mii@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.23.239.161","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406571917,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"YoBodatie","Id":279193,"Name":"YoBodatie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.144.199.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64d2318cc3af27b8e15cf6bc4a76c5ac","RawContent":"Hi, I am also a 2015 bride, I recently got assigned my wedding planner at the resort, and so far all I&#039;ve received was an email with about 10 attachments and when I asked what information she needed from me to get started all she did was send a check list and tell me to choose a location. I emailed her at the beginning of this week to try and get pictures of possible ceremony locations and have yet to get those, and I emailed to set up a phone conversation and I cannot talk to her until September 30, which I find quite annoying.\n\nIf I were you I would keep calling the direct line in the email that I believe Michelle sends out. I got a hold of her yesterday to voice my concerns about the planner I was assigned.\n\n[quote name=\"YoBodatie\" post=\"1872041\" timestamp=\"1410931351\"]\nHi, I am a 2015 bride. Anyone have a hard time with the Miami office? It&#039;s like pulling teeth to get anything figured out. I have sent over my deposit beginning of last week, did not hear anything back for a whole week. I emailed the lady asking if she had everything and if it was all ok cause she had yet to run my card and she sent me one back saying \" she will have a conformation for me shortly.\" Well needless to say it&#039;s been 2 days since then and when I call I only get an automated voice telling me \" is on the phone\".. I&#039;m clueless and nervous! I just wanna get past the Miami office and speak with someone in PC, but, for me it is seeming difficult!!! Is it only me or have others had trouble with them?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1872194,"PostDate":1411057712,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi, I am also a 2015 bride, I recently got assigned my wedding planner at the resort, and so far all I've received was an email with about 10 attachments and when I asked what information she needed from me to get started all she did was send a check list and tell me to choose a location. I emailed her at the beginning of this week to try and get pictures of possible ceremony locations and have yet to get those, and I emailed to set up a phone conversation and I cannot talk to her until September 30, which I find quite annoying.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If I were you I would keep calling the direct line in the email that I believe Michelle sends out. I got a hold of her yesterday to voice my concerns about the planner I was assigned.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>YoBodatie, on 16 September 2014 - 09:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi, I am a 2015 bride. Anyone have a hard time with the Miami office? It's like pulling teeth to get anything figured out. I have sent over my deposit beginning of last week, did not hear anything back for a whole week. I emailed the lady asking if she had everything and if it was all ok cause she had yet to run my card and she sent me one back saying \" she will have a conformation for me shortly.\" Well needless to say it's been 2 days since then and when I call I only get an automated voice telling me \" is on the phone\".. I'm clueless and nervous! I just wanna get past the Miami office and speak with someone in PC, but, for me it is seeming difficult!!! Is it only me or have others had trouble with them?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindsaymbock@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.144.199.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409858963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LMS","Id":279688,"Name":"LMS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.57.130.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"864bacbb7bce8523e165c838eef40f87","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LMS\" post=\"1870568\" timestamp=\"1409860643\"]\nI am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock&#039;s WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?\n\n\nThanks!!![\/quote]I&#039;m a December 2015 bride too!! What day\/time are you?!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882075,"PostDate":1420602798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LMS, on 04 September 2014 - 11:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock's WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I'm a December 2015 bride too!! What day\/time are you?!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"babe_alert14@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.52.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419970557,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281527.jpg?_r=1422911211","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Brunette14","Id":281527,"Name":"Brunette14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.144.199.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c77170b12561aaca312b97da45cc1a5c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Brunette14\"] Our wedding is December 12 at 3pm I believe&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882095,"PostDate":1420640001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281527\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281527-brunette14\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Brunette14<\/span><\/a> Our wedding is December 12 at 3pm I believe<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindsaymbock@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.144.199.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409858963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LMS","Id":279688,"Name":"LMS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"464f5c6fb0f7d525dad78eecea147b08","RawContent":"We are a WOW Agency and we offer great rates, group amenities, specialized knowledge on the property, great contacts with the wedding and groups department as well as offering a complimentary $3000 wedding package to a few brides and grooms (but these are limited).\n\nIf you would like some rates or information, contact me in the link in my signature :)\n[quote name=\"LMS\" post=\"1870568\" timestamp=\"1409860643\"]\nI am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock&#039;s WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?\n\n\nThanks!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1882110,"PostDate":1420645483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are a WOW Agency and we offer great rates, group amenities, specialized knowledge on the property, great contacts with the wedding and groups department as well as offering a complimentary $3000 wedding package to a few brides and grooms (but these are limited).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you would like some rates or information, contact me in the link in my signature <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LMS, on 04 September 2014 - 11:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock's WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":190,"NextPage":200,"PreviousPage":180,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
