{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.184.84.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9290b4472648213669ad43d7381b6e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations to all of the brides! I am a WOW Specialist and one of the BDW TA&#039;s specializing in Dominican Republic. Happy to answer any questions you may have. Please feel free to contact me at patty@wrighttravelagency.com. Thanks! TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882713,"PostDate":1421135455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations to all of the brides! I am a WOW Specialist and one of the BDW TA's specializing in Dominican Republic. Happy to answer any questions you may have. Please feel free to contact me at patty@wrighttravelagency.com. Thanks! TA Patty<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278657480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.206.77.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a15ac41b5c9ddbc4cac12f576d3c097","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am having such a hard time trying to estimate how much a wedding would cost me here. I like the elegant ivory collection&amp;nbsp; ($3500) but I will have approximately 160 guests. So I know that the private reception and cocktail hour is \"free\" but I guess I have to add in the costs of the decor? Is that the round table \"additional options\" I see? So 20 tables at $300 is $6k. And I read somewhere that if you have guests above the 30, then it costs an extra $8 per chair? So for the ceremony do I need to add on an expense of $8 for the extra 130 people?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m just so confused - has anyone developed a spreadsheet or something based on their guests above 30 people? I&#039;m afraid that the costs will add up to more than I can afford.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;ANY input would be super helpful! Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883098,"PostDate":1421433223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone,<\/p>\n<p>I am having such a hard time trying to estimate how much a wedding would cost me here. I like the elegant ivory collection\u00a0 ($3500) but I will have approximately 160 guests. So I know that the private reception and cocktail hour is \"free\" but I guess I have to add in the costs of the decor? Is that the round table \"additional options\" I see? So 20 tables at $300 is $6k. And I read somewhere that if you have guests above the 30, then it costs an extra $8 per chair? So for the ceremony do I need to add on an expense of $8 for the extra 130 people?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm just so confused - has anyone developed a spreadsheet or something based on their guests above 30 people? I'm afraid that the costs will add up to more than I can afford.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>ANY input would be super helpful! Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tatiana.morales@sbschools.org","IpAddress":"50.206.77.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421357138,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tbg0819","Id":281739,"Name":"tbg0819","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.166.198.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce71927dbfc575e3e0222c24baff6cd6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KerriAnn5\" post=\"1676363\" timestamp=\"1350660433\"]\nHi Ladies!!! Any 2014 HR brides out there? I didn&#039;t see a specific thread for us so i figured id start one. My wedding is March 8th 2014[\/quote]Hey,\n\ndo you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?\n[quote name=\"magalla78\" post=\"1851617\" timestamp=\"1400706559\"]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Hello!!![\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Hoping to get some guidance from anyone who has gotten married or is getting married at the Hard Rock in Punta Cana, Dominican Republic.[\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]My current issue of the day is offering my guests local \/ near by resorts as alternate options to staying at the Hard Rock Punta Cana. Does anyone have any suggestions??? Feedback would be WONDERFUL!!! My wedding is scheduled for Feb 14 2015 and I am working with Maryln in Miami. [\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Hoping to make some DW friends!! [\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Cheers,[\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Maggie [\/font][\/color][\/quote]Hey,\n\ndo you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?\n[quote name=\"LMS\" post=\"1870568\" timestamp=\"1409860643\"]\nI am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock&#039;s WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?\n\n\nThanks!!![\/quote]i&#039;ve worked with marlyn tobon, shes so responsive at the HRH...\n[quote name=\"Lotty2012\" post=\"1837736\" timestamp=\"1394633845\"]\nTam, we used HDC for our pictures. If you get me an e-mail address I would be glad to share them with you. We got our pictures on CD three days after the wedding. We were totally blown away by the quality of what we received. We had 52 people in attendance and in total it probably cost us $25k. But that is a total budget and a lot of things that most brides and grooms don&#039;t pay for. Back that out those costs and it probably would have cost us $20k.....and that was with two free three hour events.\n\nHello Kiki2289!\n\nWe used the HR DJ and we felt like we were partying in our favorite clubs in DC or Philly. We were nervous about it but it went as well as could be expected. Just give them the list of songs that your WC will ask you for and they will be able to tell what you like!\n\nWe had our wedding at 4pm. The ceremony was over at 4:30 and then we took a group picture with all our guests. By that time it was 4:45 and the guests went to too the cocktail hour. My wife and I started our pictures at around 4:45 and we didn&#039;t get done until 5:45 or so. I must admit....I was tired and ready to party but it went well. We used HDC and Milan really helped us capture every shot we wanted! Good luck and let me know if I can be of assistance.\n\nBarry[\/quote]Hey,\n\ndo you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?\n[quote name=\"Biminih\" post=\"1821291\" timestamp=\"1388522941\"]\nHas anyone used the photography service offered through the hard rock, if so how were they? My wedding is in March, not sure if we should use them or someone outside. Thanks for your help![\/quote]Hey,\n\ndo you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?","Attachments":[],"Id":1885875,"PostDate":1423591509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KerriAnn5, on 19 October 2012 - 07:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies!!! Any 2014 HR brides out there? I didn't see a specific thread for us so i figured id start one. My wedding is March 8th 2014<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>do you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>magalla78, on 21 May 2014 - 01:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hello!!!<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hoping to get some guidance from anyone who has gotten married or is getting married at the Hard Rock in Punta Cana, Dominican Republic.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">My current issue of the day is offering my guests local \/ near by resorts as alternate options to staying at the Hard Rock Punta Cana. Does anyone have any suggestions??? Feedback would be WONDERFUL!!! My wedding is scheduled for Feb 14 2015 and I am working with Maryln in Miami.\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hoping to make some DW friends!!\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Cheers,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Maggie\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>do you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LMS, on 04 September 2014 - 11:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am planning my wedding for December 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel. Right now I am trying to pick a travel agent to work with. Has anyone ever worked with one of Hard Rock's WOW Specialist? If you have what were some of the benefits that came along with doing that?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>i've worked with marlyn tobon, shes so responsive at the HRH...<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lotty2012, on 12 March 2014 - 06:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Tam, we used HDC for our pictures. If you get me an e-mail address I would be glad to share them with you. We got our pictures on CD three days after the wedding. We were totally blown away by the quality of what we received. We had 52 people in attendance and in total it probably cost us $25k. But that is a total budget and a lot of things that most brides and grooms don't pay for.\u00a0Back that out those costs and it probably would have cost us $20k.....and that was with two free three hour events.<\/p>\n<br><p>Hello Kiki2289!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We used the HR DJ and we felt like we were partying in our favorite clubs in DC or Philly. We were nervous about it but it went as well as could be expected. Just give them the list of songs that your WC will ask you for and they will be able to tell what you like!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We had our wedding at 4pm. The ceremony was over at 4:30 and then we took a group picture with all our guests. By that time it was 4:45 and the guests went to\u00a0too the\u00a0cocktail hour.\u00a0My wife and I started our pictures at around 4:45 and we didn't get done until 5:45 or so. I must admit....I was tired and ready to party but it went well. We used HDC and Milan really helped us capture every shot we wanted! Good luck and let me know if I can be of assistance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Barry<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>do you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Biminih, on 31 December 2013 - 12:49 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Has anyone used the photography service offered through the hard rock, if so how were they? My wedding is in March, not sure if we should use them or someone outside. Thanks for your help!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>do you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaritzataveras@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.166.198.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394546632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277086.jpg?_r=1394547091","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":147,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gameeljary","Id":277086,"Name":"gameeljary","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":false,"ShowEmoticons":false,"IpAddress":"69.143.75.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69910,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a395e0630dab3e4bcc911e95a3ae16e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did the HRPC allow you guys to change wedding d\u00e9cor during your ceremony? Is it true the HRPC does a wedding every hour?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895889,"PostDate":1431314992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did the HRPC allow you guys to change wedding d\u00e9cor during your ceremony? Is it true the HRPC does a wedding every hour?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrfatta2012@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.143.75.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431313416,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nicole2016","Id":283053,"Name":"Nicole2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":204,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":200,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":190,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
