ts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Riu Palace<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Royalton Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Secrets Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Valentin Imperial Maya<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Zoetry Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u2026and more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Terms and Conditions:<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00a0Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY. A minimum of 15 paid rooms with a minimum of 5 nights per room (or a total of 75 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.\u00a0 Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.\u00a0 Airfare must be booked and paid to Wright Travel Agency, LLC or its supplier to receive a credit towards coach tickets.\u00a0 Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel (valid for the wedding couple only when traveling from any US gateway, for a maximum value of $1,000.00 total for both tickets).\u00a0 Customer is responsible for any cancellation fees once airline tickets have been issued.\u00a0 Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.\u00a0 Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.\u00a0 Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.230.226.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c635dd362e2fa859eedf05958d7acef8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have an amazing opportunity for anyone getting married at HR Punta Cana between April 10-16th! I am a professional wedding and lifestyle photographer coming to shoot a conference at the resort. I am looking for a lucky bride who would like her wedding\/portraits to be photographed &lt;strong&gt;complimentary!&lt;\/strong&gt; Please reach out to me for details.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.RipeResolution.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;melissa@riperesolution.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope we can connect!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kindest,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Melissa&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892080,"PostDate":1428367627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have an amazing opportunity for anyone getting married at HR Punta Cana between April 10-16th! I am a professional wedding and lifestyle photographer coming to shoot a conference at the resort. I am looking for a lucky bride who would like her wedding\/portraits to be photographed <strong>complimentary!<\/strong> Please reach out to me for details.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>www.RipeResolution.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>melissa@riperesolution.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope we can connect!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kindest,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Melissa<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mlssadsouza@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.118.184","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391531640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"riperesolution","Id":276496,"Name":"riperesolution","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
