{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ea37a7281c297a6619102fc72b9b0e6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KerriAnn5\"]\nHi Ladies! Jamielynn...Check with your TA and with Hard Rock because according to the documents i have you have to have 25 rooms booked in order to qualify for the free private functions. My wedding is in 2014 so yours could be different but that is what they have in my documents I was given while i did my site visit and from my WC in Miami. The communication with this resort is the biggest problem i have been coming across so i only e mail my WC now so i have everything she tells me on record[\/quote] your wedding group contract (which means all of your guests booking together under one contact) has to collect 75 room nights or 11 rooms for a week. This will provide you with 3 hours a day of private parties (1 hour cocktail-2 hours dinner) anything above and beyond those hours you pay per table for service per hour. And that just includes there standards linens and table set ups.","Attachments":[],"Id":1676768,"PostDate":1350781568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"KerriAnn5\" url=\"\/t\/81901\/clueless&#045;bride&#045;13&#045;hard&#045;rock&#045;punta&#045;cana#post_1825917\"><p>Hi Ladies! Jamielynn...Check with your TA and with Hard Rock because according to the documents i have you have to have 25 rooms booked in order to qualify for the free private functions. My wedding is in 2014 so yours could be different but that is what they have in my documents I was given while i did my site visit and from my WC in Miami. The communication with this resort is the biggest problem i have been coming across so i only e mail\u00a0my WC now so i have everything she tells me on record<\/p><\/blockquote> your wedding group contract (which means all of your guests booking together under one contact) has to collect 75 room nights or 11 rooms for a week. This will provide you with 3 hours a day of private parties (1 hour cocktail-2 hours dinner) anything above and beyond those hours you pay per table for service per hour. And that just includes there standards linens and table set ups.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamiekennysuzor@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1334805758,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254226.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jamielynn55","Id":254226,"Name":"Jamielynn55","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98be234150f60d4efca4023d45715ee6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!!! I just got engaged this past weekend and so the wedding planning has begun!!! I was considereing HRH or Paradisus but am undecided about which one. does anyone know how I can contacts someone from the wedding team at HRH, also if any of you ladies who have been married there can give me some info on hos it went. thanks so much!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1695938,"PostDate":1355767977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!!! I just got engaged this past weekend and so the wedding planning has begun!!! I was considereing HRH or Paradisus but am undecided about which one. does anyone know how I can contacts someone from the wedding team at HRH, also if any of you ladies who have been married there can give me some info on hos it went. thanks so much!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"auracelis.soto@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355763747,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263306.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aury1214","Id":263306,"Name":"aury1214","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f658624a116648214ad1daa12ae863d1","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KerriAnn5[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies! Jamielynn...Check with your TA and with Hard Rock because according to the documents i have you have to have 25 rooms booked in order to qualify for the free private functions. My wedding is in 2014 so yours could be different but that is what they have in my documents I was given while i did my site visit and from my WC in Miami. The communication with this resort is the biggest problem i have been coming across so i only e mail my WC now so i have everything she tells me on record[\/quote] \n Yes- I am getting married at the Hard Rock July 2013 and I already booked over 30 rooms and I was told the max I will get is 2 free private functions. In order to get that you have to book at least 25 rooms. If anyone was given other information please share. Thanks =)","Attachments":[],"Id":1714251,"PostDate":1359676337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KerriAnn5<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies! Jamielynn...Check with your TA and with Hard Rock because according to the documents i have you have to have 25 rooms booked in order to qualify for the free private functions. My wedding is in 2014 so yours could be different but that is what they have in my documents I was given while i did my site visit and from my WC in Miami. The communication with this resort is the biggest problem i have been coming across so i only e mail\u00a0my WC now so i have everything she tells me on record<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Yes- I am getting married at the Hard Rock July 2013 and I already booked over 30 rooms and I was told the max I will get is 2 free private functions. In order to get that you have to book at least 25 rooms. If anyone was given other information please share. Thanks =)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ideangelis411@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351395598,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261844.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ideangelis411","Id":261844,"Name":"ideangelis411","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c092531b0504a1834547259ef0537c29","RawContent":"&lt;h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_569\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; Hello Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Brides and Grooms,&lt;\/h2&gt; &lt;h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_805\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; Just a reminder that we posted the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84211\/hard-rock-all-inclusive-resorts-wedding-webinar-sat-february-23-2013-9-00am-pst\"&gt;registration information for the Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Wedding Webinar Scheduled for Saturday, February 23, 2013 @ 9:00am PST.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt; &lt;h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_607\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt; This will be a great webinar where you can learn about the new wedding packages as well as get your wedding questions answered!&lt;\/h2&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715929,"PostDate":1360006839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_569\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> Hello Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Brides and Grooms,<\/h2> <h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_805\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> Just a reminder that we posted the\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84211\/hard-rock-all-inclusive-resorts-wedding-webinar-sat-february-23-2013-9-00am-pst' class='bbc_url' title=''>registration information for the Hard Rock All-Inclusive Resorts Wedding Webinar Scheduled for Saturday, February 23, 2013 @ 9:00am PST.<\/a><\/h2> <h2 id=\"user_yui_3_7_3_1_1360000894329_607\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1em; color: rgb(183, 107, 70); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"> This will be a great webinar where you can learn about the new wedding packages as well as get your wedding questions answered!<\/h2>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.166.198.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f74a02c968b425f156227b84ef6c0d05","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KimmyB\" post=\"1676475\" timestamp=\"1350674060\"]\nKerriAnn,\n\nI am also a 2014 bride to be.  I received my contract and just need to send in my deposit.  I have also researched photographers and videographers.  Still need to pick sites for wedding, food, decorations.  I would love to see what you have found out and I will let you know what I have found out.  Just private message me and we can discuss.  Thanks alot!\n\nKimmyB[\/quote]Hey,\n\ndo you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?","Attachments":[],"Id":1885879,"PostDate":1423591722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KimmyB, on 19 October 2012 - 11:14 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>KerriAnn,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am also a 2014 bride to be.\u00a0 I received my contract and just need to send in my deposit.\u00a0 I have also researched photographers and videographers.\u00a0 Still need to pick sites for wedding, food, decorations.\u00a0 I would love to see what you have found out and I will let you know what I have found out.\u00a0 Just private message me and we can discuss.\u00a0 Thanks alot!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>KimmyB<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>do you have any pics of the resort? any tips on centerpieces, outside vendors, cake, music and photos?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaritzataveras@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.166.198.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394546632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277086.jpg?_r=1394547091","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":147,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gameeljary","Id":277086,"Name":"gameeljary","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
